DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\,\\r\n\\r\nFirstly I wanted to thank you for informi
 ng Maon that Daniel & I were in the Zoom room.\\r\n\\r\nSorry\, I said 1
 7 March buyou are right it is the 16.3. Unfortunately I was unable to ma
 ke any changes as I could have just moved that hour to another day. I wa
 s in Room F4.27 completing the grading and figured the system registered
  that I was there working. Next time I will ensure that I just stop at 9
 pm. Is the time record in order\, now or shoul we amend anything.\\r\n\\
 r\nThanks in advance\\r\nbesegards\\r\nKrishne\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n​\\r\n
 \\r\n-------- Original-Nachricht --nBetreff: Re: Can you please check 16
 th March\\r\nDatum: Dienstag\, April 11\, 2023 10:08 CEST\\r\nVon: "Kris
 hne Reddy-Hrisenko" <hrisenko@technikum-wienat>\\r\nAn: "Mark Adams" <ad
 ams@technikum-wien.at>\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nDear Mark\,\\r just checked March a
 nd noticed that on the 17 March it states 22:00. This was just a one off
  where I stayed longer and continued to finish up something and before I
  knew it\, it was 10 pm. To be honest\, I don't mind if it is deleted\, 
 it was just an exception\, definately not the rule.\\r\n\\r\nBestegards\
 \r\nKrishne\\r\n\\r\n-------- Original-Nachricht --------\\r\nBetreff: C
 ou please check 16th March\\r\nDatum: Montag\, April 10\, 2023 15:48 CES
 T\\ron: Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\\r\nAn: Krishne Reddy-Hrise
 nko <hrienko@technikum-wien.at>\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nHI Krishne\,\\r\n\\r\nIn M
 arch it says tha worked from 8:45 in the morning until 22:00\\r\nand the
 refore have extra ovrtime at extra rate. I can see you had 7\\r\nhours b
 ut cant see you working ntil 10 at night. Did you? Please let me\\r\nkno
 w.\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n--\\r\nBest reg\,\\r\n\\r\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\\r\
 nEntrepreneurship & Communications\\r\nKtenzfeldleitung Sprachen\\r\n\\r
 \nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\\r\nHöchstädatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\\r\nT: +
 43 (0)1 3334077-5178\\r\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wn.at\\r\nI:www.techniku
 m-wien.at\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n
