BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20220901T163216Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear students\, dear colleagues\, \n\n\n\nAfter we had to ta
 ke a break for two years\, we are happy to be able to\n\nwelcome you to 
 the Semester Kick-off.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nFriday\, September 9th 2022 at 7:
 30 pm\n\n\n\nvenue: Fähnrich´s Restaurant (Stromstraße 19 | 1200 Wien).\
 n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nIf you want to join this event\, please confirm your att
 endance via e-mail:\n\n<mailto:carla.hartl@technikum-wien.at> carla.hart
 l@technikum-wien.at until\n\nWednesday\, September 7th at the latest.\n\
 n\n\nPlease note that a later confirmation for organizational reasons is
  not\n\npossible.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nEach person who confirms their partici
 pation will receive a voucher from us\n\nat the beginning of the welcome
  party. The vouchers can only be redeemed on\n\nSeptember 9th. Per vouch
 er you can choose:\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n• 1 soft-drink/0.33l beer/wine or cof
 fee/tea \n\n\n\n• 1 small meal\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nFurther consumption is po
 ssible at your own expense.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nWe are looking forward to se
 eing you soon and please don’t forget to confirm\n\nyour attendance!\n\n
 \n\n \n\n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nCarla Hartl\n\n\n\nSt
 udiengangsassistentin Bachelor's Distance Study Degree Program Electroni
