DESCRIPTION:Oh yes\, sorry\, I hadn't thought of that - 31.01. at 11 am?
 \n\n\nAm Dienstag\, November 28\, 2023 11:29 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <a
 dams@echnikum-wien.at>:\n\n  \n\nThe problem is that we have semester br
 eak the and I cannot say if I am here or not during the break.  Semester
  starts again on 15th which is probably a bit late if you have changes t
 hat need to be made.\n\n  On 28.11.23 11:12\, Cosima Neuberger wrote:Hi\
 , would a laer date also be possible? e.g. in calendar week 6 or 7?\n\n\
 n\nAm Mittwoch\november 22\, 2023 14:30 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <adams@
 technikum-wien.at>:\n\n   \n\nHi Cosima\,\n\nWed 31st Jan anytime betwee
 n 9 and 12?\n\n On11.23 19:28\, Cosima Neuberger wrote:Hi Mr. Adams\,\n\
 n\n\nI would like to nd in the paper in February. The presentation will 
 probably take place on February 20th. Would you like to make an appointm
 ent right away?\n\n\n\nBestegards\n\nCosima Neuberger\n\n\n\nAm Mittwoch
 \, November 15\, 2023 16:10 CE schrieb "Adams Mark (über FHTW Moodle)" <
 noreply@technikum-wien.at>:\n\nMGR-VZ-3-WS2023-ENG » Foren » Announcemen
 ts » Final versions of papers for EnglishFinal versions of papers for En
 glishvon Adams Mark - Mittwoch\, 15. November 2023\, 16:09 \n\nHi Everyb
 ody\,\n\nI have now added a link herin the moodle course to a doodle for
  the second part of the English course. Please choose an appointment and
  then upload your final versions to the correct upload area. \n\nIf anyo
 ne is finished before the end of the month ad wants to have an earlier a
 ppointment please get in touch. We can probably find something sooner. I
 f you are not handing in the paper for this appointment\, rather the one
  in January or February (I think there is a second date\, correct?)\, th
 en please let me know per email\, so that I do not keep bombarding you w
 ith requests to make appointments or hand things in. In this case\, we c
 an do the corrections to the final versions before you hand the paper in
  later.\n\nThanks.\n\n  Diskussion im Forum zeigen _____________________
 _______________________________________________________\n\nEinstelungen 
 zur Zusammenfassung neuer Forenbeiträge ändern\n\nLesen Sie dies ineiner
  E-Mail? Laden Sie die mobile App und empfangen Sie alle Mitteilungen au
 f Ihrem mobilen Endgerät.\n\n\n\n -- \n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark AdaM
 .A. O.D.E.\n\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung 
 Spchen\n\n\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200
  W\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-5178\n\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI:www.
 technum-wien.at\n\n\n\n -- \n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O
 .D.E.\nepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\
 n\n\nFachhschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\nT: 
 +43 (0)1 33077-5178\n\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI:www.technikum
 -wien.at\n\n
