DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark Adams\\r\n\\r\nIt’s time to renew your IATEFL inst
 itional membership! We hope that\\r\nyou have enjoyed being part of our 
 Englih Language Teaching community.\\r\n\\r\n \\r\n\\r\nYOUR MEMBERSHIP 
 DETAILS\\r\nMembership Type is Institutional\\r\nYour Membership Expiry 
 Date is 23rd Mrch\, 2024\\r\n \\r\n\\r\nHOW DO I RENEW MY MEMBERSHIP?\\r
 \nSimply log in to tATEFL website\, using your username and password\, t
 o\\r\nsee your renewaloptions via 'MY DASHBOARD'. \\r\n\\r\nIf you selec
 t the 'I will pay later' oion\, an invoice will be emailed to\\r\nyou wi
 th further instructions.\\r\n \\r\n\\r\nREMINDER OF MEMBER BENEFITS\\r\n
 \\r\nVisit the 'Membership' sectionthe IATEFL website for the various\\r
 \nmembership types and benefits. \\r\nQUESTIONS ABOUT YOUR MEMBERSHIP?\\
 r\nIf you have any queries regarding membeship please contact\\r\nmember
 ship@iatefl.org\, or call us on +44 (0)1795 51414. \\r\n\\r\nOur office 
 is open from 9am to 5pm (UK time)\, Monday to Frid.\\r\n\\r\n \\r\n\\r\n
 We look forward to renewing your membership and seeing at an IATEFL\\r\n
 event soon!\\r\n \\r\nYours sincerely\\r\n\\r\n \\r\n\\r\nIATEFRSHIP SUP
