 \nOn 24.04.22 07:02\, Lukas Feichtinger wrote:\n\nGood morning!\n\n\n\nI
  talked to Andrea and the 12th fits us both. When do you want to start?\
 n\nI figured 14:00 would be a good time.\n\n____________________________
 ____\n\nFrom: Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at><mailto:adams@techniku
 m-wien.at>\n\nSent: Friday\, April 22\, 2022 12:11 PM\n\nTo: Lukas Feich
 tinger <Lukas.Feichtinger@htw.wien><mailto:Lukas.Feichtinger@htw.wien>\n
 \nSubject: Re: Projekt Kitchen - VR Event\, Tabletennis\n\n\n\n\n\n13th 
 to 22nd I am at a conference in Belfast. The week after that howver I ha
 ve practically nothing all week so I would be available in that week at 
