 .Feichtinger@htw.wien><mailto:Lukas.Feichtinger@htw.wien>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 nSome possible dates:\n\n\n\n\n\n3rd May after 16:30\n\n\n\n6th May at 1
 8:00\n\n\n\n10th\, 11th\, 12th May anytime (actually free all day so cou
 ld work there and have people drop in over several hours some during day
  and some after 5 if you wanted\, but might be too complicated for the f
 irst time)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 19.04.22 16:57\, Lukas Feichtinger wrot
