 hnikum-wien.at>\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nStart September 2022 \n\n\n\n-          
    Course 1: Engine – International Project Work across times zones and 
 cultures (more hours than planned for IoCEST\, needs a more expressive t
 itle/ clear content\, at the moment students don’t know what they are si
