 not done\;-)).\n\nIf you need an answer now\, I would say no\, the stude
 nts should please \n\nbring their own laptops to be on the save side! Th
 at has nothing todo \n\nwith planning but simply wit available EDV rooms
 .\n\nIn 1 Month maybe we are able to have better news for you - because 
 also \n\nRichard Elgner needs to know if we (FHTW) need more EDV rooms o
 r not to \n\norder equipment....\n\nSorry!\n\nBest regards\n\nElke\n\n>\
