DESCRIPTION:Ok\, let’s do it on 19th after your exam. It’ll all be fresh
  in my mind. Over lunch maybe?\n\n\n\nIt’s really no problem – it’lle a 
 chance to catch up 😊\n\n\n\nCath\n\n\n\nFrom: Mark Adams <adams@techm-w
 ien.at>\n\nSent: Montag\, 8. Mai 2023 14:00\n\nTo: PREWETT-SCHREMPF Cath
 ine | FHWien der WKW <catherine.prewett@fh-wien.ac.at>\n\nSubject: Re: E
 nglsh for Professional Purposes 1: WS23/24 Briefing meetings\n\n\n\n\n\n
 19th a2 after the exam\n\n\n\n21st after 11:30\n\n\n\n22nd all day (onli
 ne)\n\n\nd any of those work for you? I am so sorry that you have to do 
 this extra with me.\n\nOn 08.05.23 13:45\, PREWETT-SCHREMPF Catherine | 
 FHWien der WKW rote:\n\nHi Mark\n\n\n\nThanks for letting us know. It’s 
 probably easier just we two (seeing as I am your coordinator in WS23/24)
  meet up so I can talk you through the syllabus. Would you have any othe
 r timeslot available that week? We can do it online too.\n\n\n\nJust a n
 ote on moving exam datesusually this is not possible as it’s FHWien poli
 cy to keep exams firmly on the dates that are communicated at the beginn
 ing of the semester. I understand that in your case things needed to be 
 shifted back\, but I’m actually surprised that Planning moved it for you
 \, also without informing Matt. I hope all your students can make it! Wo
 uld be good to always keep Matt/your coordinator in the loop.\n\n\n\nChe
 ers\,\n\nCath\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Mark Addams@technikum-wien.at><mailto:ada
 ms@technikum-wien.at>\n\nSent: Montag\, 8 Mai 2023 11:17\n\nTo: PREWETT-
 SCHREMPF Catherine | FHWien der WKW <catherie.prewett@fh-wien.ac.at><mai
 lto:catherine.prewett@fh-wien.ac.at>\n\nSubject Re: English for Professi
 onal Purposes 1: WS23/24 Briefing meetings\n\n\n\nHi  Cath\,\n\n\n\nUnfo
 rtunately my exam lesson was moved due to a conferen and I am therefore 
 sitting in a the BeFun exam now on Monday 19th and I cannot attend the o
 ne on Tuesday 20th as I am hosting then. Is there any chance of at least
  listening in? I could wear an earbud and listen in while the class is d
 oing the exam. Sorry for the inconvenience.\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 08.05.10:12\, 
 PREWETT-SCHREMPF Catherine | FHWien der WKW wrote:\n\nHello and thaks ve
 ry much everyone for indicating which EPP1 planning meeting you can atte
 nd.\n\n\n\nOn the basis of your choices\, we will only need to hold two 
 mtings\, so please mark your calendars (I will also send an Outlook invi
 te) and join us according to the list below:\n\n\n\nMonday 19th June (wi
 th Matt Cath) from 09.00 to 10.30 am in B433\n\nBiljana\n\nNayeem\n\nLis
 a\n\nSilvBarbara\n\nMark\n\nPaul\n\n\n\nTuesday 20th June (with Linda & 
 Andrew) from0 to 3.30 pm in B433\n\nSamia\n\nNora\n\nHeinz\n\nChristine\
 n\nMichi\n\nLaJill\n\nJason\n\nRazaq\n\n\n\nWe are looking forward to wa
 lking you through new course.\n\n\n\nYour CALM CCBE team\,\n\nCath\, And
 rew\, Linda and Mat\n\n\n\nFrom: PREWETT-SCHREMPF Catherine | FHWien der
  WKW\n\nSent: Montag\, April 2023 17:41\n\nTo: FELLINGER Michaela <micha
 ela.fellinger@edu.fh-wienac.at><mailto:michaela.fellinger@edu.fh-wien.ac
 .at>\; FILZMOSER Barbara <barbara.filzmoser@edu.fh-wien.ac.at><mailto:ba
 rbara.filzmoser@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; SAVIC Biljana <biljana.savic@edu.fh
