DESCRIPTION:Great! Thanks\, Mark!\\r\n\\r\n-------- Original Message ---
 ----nSubject: Re: Fwd: AW: Erasmus+ staff mobility opportunities to GENT
 \\r\nDat: Wednesday\, July 12\, 2023 09:57 CEST\\r\nFrom: Mark Adams <ad
 ams@techniku-wien.at>\\r\nTo: Patrick Loan <loan@technikum-wien.at>\\r\n
 References: <38c3-64ad2780-c9-1c19b420@175392203>\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r
 \nI like the idea of keept low key. We should however talk with the inte
 rnational office\, though if it is on a Freiwilliger basis then nobody c
 an really say anything\, but still. I will talk to them tomorrow and jus
 t make sure that we are not stepping on anyones toes :-)\\r\n On 11.07.2
 3 11:56\, Patrick Loan wrote:Hi Mark\\r\n\\r\nHope you're doing well and
  nearly finishing up the semester!\\r\n\\ronder what you think of the id
 ea to keep the project relatively low-key\, and I've also been in contac
 t with the guy in Gent\, and he wants to keep the project really simple 
 as well. It would entail students from the Technikum getting involved vo
 luntarily\, so we wouldn't necessarily have to think about Erasmus+ fund
 ing for the Technikum at the moment\, but if it goes well then we could 
 expand it in the future\\r\n\\r\n1. September 2023 -  get stunts from Te
 chnikum involved (between 6 - 10) - convince students & departments it w
 ould be a good idea/ benefit them\, and sell it to them!\\r\n2. Noveber 
 2023 - I would go to Gent for 2-days to give a series of F2F workshops (
 about art\, technology and collaborative projects)\, and get Technikum s
 tudents to join online to propose and outline a potential interdisciplin
 ary collaborative project with both institutions - if Nov workshops go w
 ell\, then move forward with stage 3.\\r\n3. March 2024 - students from 
 Gent come ona student visit to Vienna (they were thinking of coming to V
 ienna on a study visit anyway) and work F2F with their Technikum partner
 s - set up small exhibition using the space where I have a studio (WEST-
 space in 9th district)\, or a space at the Technikum. Materials for exhi
 bition would need to be borrowed or provided by the students\, I have so
 me equipment available (projector + flat screen TVs etc)\\r\n\\r\nWould 
 really appreciate your thoughts  this and if you have any ideas how we c
 ould best move forward with the project - thanks!\\r\n\\r\nAll the best\
 ,\\r\nPatrick\\r\n\\r\n-------- Original Me --------\\r\nSubject: Re: Fw
 d: AW: Erasmus+ staff mobility opportunities toGENT\\r\nDate: Thursday\,
  June 22\, 2023 17:00 CEST\\r\nFrom: Mark Adams <ada@technikum-wien.at>\
 \r\nTo: Patrick Loan <loan@technikum-wien.at>\\r\nReferens: <12ed0b-6492
 1a80-6f-12a4faa0@247160947>\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nHi Patrick\, this is
  fine for the individual travel and your teaching there which comes unde
 r Erasmus mobility\, but it does not have anything to do with any kind o
 f cooperation on a formal level for a project. This would need to be dis
 cussed with the international office before you make any kind of plans o
 r promises.\\r\n   On 20.06.23 23:31\, Patrick Loan wrote:Hi Mark\,\\r\n
 \\r\nThis the recent (this Monday 19th June) message I got from Nina in 
 the international office.\\r\n\\r\nBest\,\\r\nPatrick\\r\n\\r\n-------- 
 Original Message ---\\r\nSubject: AW: Erasmus+ staff mobility opportunit
 ies to GENT\\r\nDate: Moay\, June 19\, 2023 14:08 CEST\\r\nFrom: "Nina T
 hiel" <ma0055@technikum-wienat>\\r\nTo: "'Patrick Loan'" <loan@technikum
 -wien.at>\\r\nReferences: <229b1-8f4500-85-3e6d5300@72228039>\\r\n\\r\n\
 \r\n\\r\n  \\r\nHi Patrick\,\\r\n\\r\n\\rds good to me. Yes\, September 
 is fine\, still enough time to complete the documents. For the time peri
 od you mentioned 14-16th of November and 2 travel days the calculated Er
 asmus+ grant would be EUR 875\,- (in case you travel green\, you can add
  another EUR 45\,-). \\r\n\\r\n\\r\n \\r\nThe grant willtransferred to t
 he faculty after having completed the Erasmus+ documents. In case you wa
 nt to book your transportation and accommodation earlier you can check w
 ith Mark what is the best way (either via our travel agency\, if the fac
 ulty advances money or if you pay it yourself and have it reimbursed).\\
 r\n\\r\n\\r\n \\r\nIf you have any more questions\, please let me know.\
 n \\r\nBest regards\\r\n\\r\nNina  \\r\n\\r\n--\\r\n\\r\nMit freundliche
 n Gründ regards\\r\n\\r\nMag. Nina Thiel\\r\n\\r\nProject- & Mobility Co
 ordinator\, ojekt- und Mobilitätskoordination\\r\nStaff Mobility | Perso
 nalmobilität\\rInternational Office | Internationales Büro\\r\n\\r\nFach
 hochschule TechnikuWien | University of Applied Sciences Technikum Wien\
 \r\nHoechstaedtplatz 6 1200 Wien\, AUSTRIA \\r\n\\r\nT: +43 1 333 40 77-
 3183\\r\nF: +43 1 333 40 77-23\\r\nE: nina.thiel@technikum-wien.at\\r\nI
 : www.technikum-wien.at\\r\n\\r\n- \\r\nBest regards\, \\r\n\\r\nMark Ad
 ams\, M.A. O.D.E. \\r\nEntrepreneurship mmunications\\r\nKompetenzfeldle
 itung Sprachen\\r\n \\r\nFachhochschule Techni Wien\\r\nHöchstädtplatz 6
 \, A-1200 Wien\\r\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\\r\nE: k.adams@technikum-wien
 .at\\r\nI: www.technikum-wien.at\\r\n -- \\r\nBest rega\, \\r\n\\r\nMark
  Adams\, M.A. O.D.E. \\r\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\\rmpetenzfel
 dleitung Sprachen\\r\n \\r\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\\r\nHöchdtplat
 z 6\, A-1200 Wien\\r\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\\r\nE: mark.adams@technik-
 wien.at\\r\nI: www.technikum-wien.at\\r
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230717T102000
