BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230717T065115Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\n\n\n\nHere is the link to my FIT Moodle course:
 \nnhttps://moodle.technikum-wien.at/course/view.php?id=22348\n\n\n\nYou 
 have ready been warned by the mediator to stop making accusative stateme
 nts. I cannot understand how you cannot find my Moodle course and why yo
 u did not communicate this to me in the first place. The mediator also a
 sked you to communicate with me\, is this your art and manner of communi
 cating? \n\n\n\nrstly\, I would like to place on record that after your 
 very serious unjustified accusation\, the Betriebsrad suggested an exter
 nal mediator be invited to resolve this conflict. These aspects were alr
 eady dealt with in the four scheduled coaching we had. A decision was ta
 ken for both of us to change certain aspects in our professional working
  relationship henceforth. I have been adhering to my side or the rules h
 owever this letter and your continued unverified\, unjustified statement
  is proof that you have not!\n\n\n\nSondly\, teaching the FIT program th
 is semester was particularly challenging because I had a substantial num
 ber of students from Iran who have never learnt English in their lives. 
 They were unable to speak let alone conduct presentations in English. As
  a professional with majors in psychology\, I had to used different mean
 s and methods to get the students across the barrier of articulation in 
 English. You are aware that I have been norminated for the category "Gut
 e Lehre" this semester? As my Kompetenzfeldleiter ​​\,  I trust you supp
 ort this as a compliment for the whole department including you.\n\n\n\n
 I have already completely changed the framework of the FITourse for SS20
 24 in the light of the fact that students were unable to deal with the s
 ubject matter and as per your suggestion I am working on a completely ne
 w course.\n\n \n\nMFG\n\nBest Regards\n\nMag. phil. Frau Krishne R-Hrise
 nko\n\nBA Majors psychology\, French & English\n\nEntrepreneurship & mmu
 nications\n\nCompetence Area- Languages\n\n\n\nUAS Technikum Vienna\n\nH
 staedtplatz 6\n\n1200 Vienna\, Austria\n\n\n\n+43 69919711959\n\ne-mail:
  hnko@technikum-wien.at\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-------- Original-Nachricht -
 ----Betreff: Official Warning\n\nDatum: Donnerstag\, Juli 13\, 2023 15:4
 3 CESTnVon: Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\n\nAn: Krishne Reddy-Hr
 isenko <hisenko@technikum-wien.at>\n\nKopie: Natalie König <natalie.koen
 ig@techniku-wien.at>\n\n\n\nReferenzen: <3cc05bb8-b380-4cea-c27d-c4c687f
 98688@technikuwien.at>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Krishne\, \n\nIn the atta
 chment you can fietter signed from both HR and our Geschäftsführer Flori
 an Eckrammer. In the discussions for the further development of the FIT 
 program\, feedback on the English courses was also given\, resulting in 
 said letter. \n\nDue to he feedback\, I have looked at your timetable an
 d have found that you are on holiday for the whole of August but are sti
 ll working during the next two weeks in July. I was unable to find a moo
 dle course for your FIT program when searching on Moodle\, but that coul
 d be that I just was unable to find it. If there is a moodle course alre
 ady\, please add me as Kompetenzfeldleiter to the the course so that I h
 ave access and can see the materials. \n\nhould there not already be a m
 oodle course for the FIT program\, then I would ask you to use some of t
 he next two weeks of your Technikum time to create a moodle course and u
 pload all of the materials that you used during the semester. This shoul
 d not take that long\, as you should already have everything in digital 
 form. Once it has been created\, please add me to it immediately. \n\nI 
 will be available from Monday onwards\, should you have any uestions abo
 ut creating the moodle course. -- \n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMardams\, M.
 A. O.D.E.\n\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleing Spr
 achen\n\n\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-0 Wie
 n\n\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-5178\n\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI:wte
 chnikum-wien.at\n\n \n\n \n\n 
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230719T110000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230719T100000
