CREATED:20230217T101316Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear All\,\n\n\n\nNo doubt you’ve all discovered\, or at lea
 sotherwise heard some hype around the ChatGPT tool...\n\n\n\nAs Mark and
  Dav mentioned in the faculty meeting in January\, it is going to presen
 t a challenge for our tried-and-tested ways of working\, particularly ar
 ound student text production\, and it will demand certain changes in our
  thinking and practice.\n\n\n\nEnglish Team ChatGPT Roundtable \n\n\n\nT
 o this end\, wlike to invite you to a roundtable discussion and workshop
  on how we can react to - and take advantage of - these developments in 
 our English courses. We’re planning to hold two sessions (both from 17:0
 0-19:00):\n\n\n\nTuesy 7 March (B6.01)\n\nThursday 23 March (B2.05)\n\n\
 n\nFeel free to attend eer one\, or indeed both\, evenings (the focus an
 d content of each will depend on the ideas and proposals put forward by 
 those present\, with the second session perhaps building on the first\, 
 depending on how the discussion develops). There will be food and wine. 
 \n\n\n\nPlease send me a quick emailf you would like to attend either of
  the sessions.\n\n\n\nTechnikum Event -hatGPT: Freund oder Feind\n\n\n\n
 The director of the master programme AI Enneering\, Dr. Bernhard Knapp\,
  will be holding a talk next Monday (20th Feb) at 17:00 in the Festsaal.
  He’ll be presenting the overall potential and limitations of ChatGPT an
 d other generative AI tools (in German). All are welcome. \n\n\n\nMore i
 nfo at https://www.technikum-wien.at/news/chatgpt-frnd-oder-feind/\n\n\n
 \nLooking forward to seeing some of you over the comingeeks!\n\n\n\nBest
 \,\n\nPaul\n\n\n\n\n\n_____________\n\n\n\nPaul Talbot\, Bs)\, M.Sc.\n\n
 Senior Lecturer and Researcher\n\nEntrepreneurship & Communicions\n\nKom
 petenzfeld Sprachen\n\n \n\nFH Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplat\, 1200 Wi
 en\n\n+43 664 889 609 64\n\ntalbot@technikum-wien.at \n\nwww.technm-wien
 .at \n\n￼\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 0744764
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230307T190000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230307T170000
LAST-MODIFIED:20230217T101358Z
LOCATION:B6.01
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:We and ChatGPT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
UID:8a84e531-551e-4115-b71e-69873d2406bc
