CREATED:20220330T081325Z
DESCRIPTION:Lieber Mark\, \n\n\n\nich kann das Problem und vor allem die
  Panik nicht nachvollziehen. \n\nGrundsätzlich sollte jeder Student sein
 e Prüfungstermine kennen\, die Termine sind wochenlang im Vorhinein eing
 etragen und kommuniziert.\n\n\n\nUm welchen Termin geht es im konkreten 
 Fall? Bitte schick uns ein konkretes Bsp. \n\nFalls Herr Lindenau PROG2 
 am 05.04. meint\, da steht es dabei\, dass es ein Nachtermin aus dem 1. 
 Semester ist. \n\n\n\nFalls es um die verplanten WH-Prüfungen geht\, die
  die Assistentin anlegt\, wäre ein WH-EXAM zum Auswählen sinnvoll\, viel
 leicht kann das eingepflegt werden\, damit man den Status der Prüfung am
  ersten Blick erkennt. \n\n\n\nLiebe Grüße\,\n\nBetty \n\n \n\nAm Dienst
 ag\, März 29\, 2022 09:05 CEST\, schrieb Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wie
 n.at>: \n\n \n\n> HI\,\n\n> \n\n> I received some feedback from the stud
 ents during an English class and \n\n> sent their request to the assiste
 nts who then suggested that it was more \n\n> a LVPlan thing than for th
 em to do. Maybe you could read the email below \n\n> and let me know if 
 you are the correct person/people to talk to in order \n\n> to solve the
  problem for the students.\n\n> \n\n> Thanks.\n\n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\
 n> Hi Mark\,\n\n> \n\n> I believe this request should rather be adressed
  to our colleagues in \n\n> the scheduling department\, they enter the f
 irst resit exams.\n\n> \n\n> The subsequent resit date and panel exam ar
 e then scheduled by the \n\n> assistant - at least in BWI.\n\n> I always
  inform the students about the exam type when I send out the \n\n> third
  or fourth (last) exam date.\n\n> BR\,\n\n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\n
 > \n\n> \n\n> -----Ursprüngliche Nachricht-----\n\n> Von: Mark Adams [ma
 ilto:adams@technikum-wien.at] Gesendet: Montag\, 21. \n\n> März 2022 10:
 30\n\n> An: tw_sek@technikum-wien.at\n\n> Betreff: Fwd: Repeat exams\n\n
 > \n\n> Hi Everybody\,\n\n> \n\n> In one of my classes the students were
  roleplaying feedback and meetings \n\n> and one of the things that came
  up was the moodle calendar and how the \n\n> students sometimes panic a
 s the Wiederholungsprüfung is in their \n\n> timetable but is not named 
 as Wiederholungsprüfung. Would it be possible \n\n> to always enter WP o
 r something in the name so that this does not happen \n\n> in future? I 
 promised the students I would write and ask.\n\n> Thanks.\n\n> \n\n> \n\
 n> \n\n> \n\n> \n\n> Dear Mr. Adams\,\n\n> \n\n> as discussed in today´s
  lesson the naming of some of the repeat exams is \n\n> very confusing a
 nd sometimes as a student this is a reason to panic.\n\n> \n\n> The exam
 ple in the pictures attached is about the PROG2 course\, which \n\n> tak
 es place in the first semester but it only says PROG2-Exam in the \n\n> 
 timetable and you think it refers to an exam this semester.\n\n> As a su
 ggestion it would be useful to name or brand every repeat exam as \n\n> 
 Wiederholungsprüfung.\n\n> \n\n> With kind regards\,\n\n> Philip Lindena
 u\n\n>
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220408T150000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220408T140000
LAST-MODIFIED:20220409T105956Z
SEQUENCE:0
