DESCRIPTION:Have a workers meeting with Krishne and put everything in wr
 iting and tell her that it is not a conversation but if she wants to mak
 e any comments\, she can put them in writing and send them back and it w
 ill be added to the workers communication file between the two of us. Ma
 ke sure to tell her about taking holidays\, any\, and all complaints and
  reprimands will be added to the file immediately and send to HR. Nothin
 g will be hidden or looked the other way talk to her about the complaint
 s that were made and how her comments about unfair\, evade and unjustifi
 ed are obviously wrong because both of the things that were complained a
 bout she actually did. Make it very clear no more meditation in any form
  whatsoever in class.\n\nDurin the meeting with the mediator in October 
 to make it very clear that all communication will now be formal because 
 of half truths\, missing context\, quotes\, and downright lies. Clarify\
 , that giving negative feedback and reprimands is not something that I l
 ike to do but he’s part of my job. These are a direct consequence of her
  own actions\, and have not to do with any kind of persecution. Also\, e
 xplain to the mediator\, why Krishne was removed from the course\, which
  was because of complaints of Being late and meditating in class for 20 
 minutes and also being unstructured and very disorganized\, this is dire
 ct feedback from students to the studio and gang \n\n\nSent from my iPho
 ne
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230904T130000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230904T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20230901T064241Z
