DESCRIPTION:Hi - here is a copy of the announcement I have posted for BI
 F students.\n\n\n\nDear Students\n\nI’m still in Scotland and don’t thin
 ’ll be back before the end of June\, so I think it’s better to make alte
 rnative arrangements rather than keep you hanging on.\n\nLesson 16 May: 
 Krshne Reddy-Hrisenko will take my lesson this week.\n\nExam lesson 28 M
 ay: Mrk Adams will take your exam lesson.\n\nPK presentation: * Please r
 eply to his announcement with your PK topic so we don’t have any the sam
 e.  I will then add them to the list on Moodle class 6. * Please upload 
 your PK plans to our Moodle self-study F by Sunday 26 May 2024 18.00.  I
  will look at these and return them to you.  (You can find an example pl
 an in SSF).You also have a short vocabulary test in the exam lesson.  * 
 For Business Types (class 1) and Finance (class 4) vocabulary\, you have
  Quizlet sets at https://quizlet.com/class/21647373. * For the Marketing
  (class 3) vocabulary\, you can look through the worksheet: What is mark
 eting discussion task (Moodle class 3). * For Ethics and CSR\, you have 
 the vocabulary exercises in Moodle self-study E.If you have any question
 s at all\, please contact me by email either on my Technikum email or at
  patrizia.spella@gmail.com.\n\nSorryfor any inconvenience caused and tha
 t I can’t be with you.\n\nBest regard\n\nPatrizia\n
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20240528T125000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20240528T094000
