DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\, \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nthat was our initial idea: \n\n\n
 \n \n\n\n\nStart September 2022 \n\n\n\n-             Course 1: Engine –
  International Project Work across times zones and cultures (more hours 
 than planned for IoCEST\, needs a more expressive title/ clear content\,
  at the moment students don’t know what they are signing up to)\n\n\n\n-
              Course 2: A combination of Erasmus+ Preparation and Intercu
 ltural Communication (merge into one course\, give it a sexy name)\n\n\n
 \nFlo needs the content until end of April should Incoming students also
  sign up for this\, however\, you will “present” Engine to the Internati
 onal faculty coordinators at the end of April.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nStart Feb
 ruary 2023\n\n\n\n-             Course 3: International Text and Speech 
 (also: add some catchy feature to the title?)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nDoes this 
 help\, can you work with that? \n\n\n\nHave a great wknd!\n\n\n\nAgnes\n
 \n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n-----Ursprüngliche Nachricht-----\n\nVon: Mark A
 dams <adams@technikum-wien.at> \n\nGesendet: Donnerstag\, 7. April 2022 
 11:42\n\nAn: 'Agnes Kriz' <kriz@technikum-wien.at>\n\nBetreff: New Campu
 s INternational Courses\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nHi Agnes\,\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nCould
  you just update David and myself and which courses need to be prepared 
 and for when? Would be great thanks.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n-- \n\n\n\
 nBest regards\,\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n\n\n\nEntrepre
 neurship & Communications\n\n\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\n\n\n  
 \n\n\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\n\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 W
 ien\n\n\n\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n\n\n\nE:  <mailto:mark.adams@technik
 um-wien.at> mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\n\n\nI:  <http://www.techniku
 m-wien.at> www.technikum-wien.at
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220414T120000
