DESCRIPTION:Hello again everyone\n\n \n\nThank you all for indicating yo
 ur availability for the upcoming EPP1 lecturer meetings.\n\n \n\nThere w
 ill be two meetings:\n\n    Monday June 3rd\, 10.00 to 11.30 in B502\n  
   Monday June 10th\, 16.00 to 17.30 in B507\n\n \n\nIf you indicated tha
 t you could do either of these dates\, please just let us know which one
  you are planning to attend by replying to this email.\n\n \n\nLooking f
 orward to seeing you all soon.\n\n \n\nYour CCBE Team\n\nCath\, Andrew\,
  Linda\, Matt\, Ming\n\n \n\n \n\nVon: PREWETT-SCHREMPF Catherine | FHWi
 en der WKW\nGesendet: Donnerstag\, 25. April 2024 11:44\nAn: FELLINGER M
 ichaela <michaela.fellinger@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; FILZMOSER Barbara <barb
 ara.filzmoser@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; SAVIC Biljana <biljana.savic@edu.fh-w
 ien.ac.at>\; HUGHES Rebecca <rebecca.hughes@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; AHMED N
 ayeem <nayeem.ahmed@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; ANIFOWOSHE Razaq <razaq.anifowo
 she@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; GALLAGER Jason <jason.gallager@edu.fh-wien.ac.a
 t>\; JEXENFLICKER Silvia <silvia.jexenflicker@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; MOORE
 -WALTER Lawrie <lawrie.moore@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; HIBBERT Simon <simon.h
 ibbert@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; HARDAKER Stephen <stephen.hardaker@edu.fh-wi
 en.ac.at>\; ADAMS Mark <mark.adams@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; NOBLE Andrew Dru
 mmond <andrew.noble@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; BERGER Lisa <lisa.berger@edu.fh
 -wien.ac.at>\nCc: Competence Center for Business English <ccbe@fh-wien.a
 c.at>\; SLATTERY Linda | FHWien der WKW <linda.slattery@fh-wien.ac.at>\;
  URMSTON Matthew | FHWien der WKW <matthew.urmston@fh-wien.ac.at>\; ZHU 
 Xiaoming | FHWien der WKW <Xiaoming.Zhu@fh-wien.ac.at>\; PULLEN Andrew J
 ames | FHWien der WKW <Andrew.Pullen@fh-wien.ac.at>\nBetreff: English fo
 r Professional Purposes 1 WS24/25: Lecturer briefing meetings\n\n \n\nDe
 ar all\,\n\n \n\nWe hope this email finds you well 😊\n\n \n\nThank you 
 all for your commitment to teach EPP1 in our first semester courses (aga
 in\, for most of you). By now you should all have received your schedule
  for the upcoming winter term from our Planning team. If not\, please le
 t us know.\n\n \n\nThere will be a few changes to the EPP1 syllabus\, wh
 ich we would like to present to you in person in a lecturer briefing mee
 ting. As all study programs have the same standardized course\, we can o
 ffer any of the three meeting times as outlined in the “Termino” below. 
 Please indicate your preference(s) within the next couple of days – by M
 onday 29th April at the latest - so that we can book suitable meeting ro
 oms. If you have already heard from Matt about this\, please be aware th
 at the timeslots below supersede what has been discussed so far with him
 .\n\nhttps://www.termino.gv.at/meet/de/p/2919395e42c091b5acd7c94d699d8aa
 7-325193\n\nThanks a lot and see you all soon!\n\n \n\nCath & the whole 
 CALMM team\n\n \n\nCatherine Prewett-Schrempf\, MSc TESOL\n\nHead of Com
 petence Center for Business English\n\n \n\nDepartment of Management\n\n
 \nFHWien der WKW\n\nUniversity of Applied Sciences for Management & Comm
 unication\n\nWähringer Gürtel 97\,\n\n1180 Wien / Vienna\, Österreich / 
 Austria\n\nT: +43 690 40476 005\n\nT: +43 (1) 476 77 5807\n\n\ncatherine
 .prewett@fh-wien.ac.at \nwww.fh-wien.ac.at\n\n \n\n \n\nFHW Fachhochschu
 l-Studiengänge Betriebs- und\nForschungseinrichtungen der Wiener Wirtsch
 aft GmbH\nHG Wien\, FN 141443f\, ATU 42913406
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20240603T113000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
