DESCRIPTION:Great! See you then!\n\n\n\nBecky\n\n\n\nSent from Outlook f
 or oid<https://aka.ms/AAb9ysg>\n\n________________________________\n\nFr
 om: Ma Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\n\nSent: Wednesday\, May 22\, 202
 4 12:24:2 PM\n\nTo: Becky Hughes <rebeccahughes88@live.co.uk>\n\nSubject
 : Re: Lecturg at FH Technikum\n\n\n\n\n\nPerfect. Easiest thing is proba
 bly to go to retion in the main building and ask them to call me and I w
 ill come down and pick you up. Looking forward to it.\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 21.0
