DESCRIPTION:Dear colleagues\,\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLet´s get the  <https://ww
 w.musdays.eu/> #ERASMUS DAYS 2022 started early. The UAS Technikum Wien 
 starts the winter semester 2022/23 with a month dedicated to internation
 alization. Between September 12 and October 15\, students and staff of t
 he UAS Technikum Wien are cordially invited to participate in  <https://
 www.technikum-wien.at/en/news/lets-get-the-erasmus-days-started-early-ua
 s-technikum-wien-starts-with-september-12-2022-into-the-erasmusdays-from
 -october-13-15-2022/> various events. For staff we would like to draw yo
 ur attention to the following ones:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n1.	Kickstart Internat
 ionalization\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n30-minutes webinars designed to provide 
 insights into selected topi related to internationalization. The session
 s will be held in German (English on request).\n\n\n\n1.	Wed 14 Septembe
 r\, 4 pm: How to teach/train abro (Erasmus+ staff mobility) with Nina Th
 iel\, International Office\n\n2.	Tue\, 27 September\, 9 am: How to organ
 ize an Erasmus+ Short term exchange (Blended Intensive Program) with Agn
 es Kriz\, International Office & Paolo Trivisonne\, Competence Center Di
 gital Manuf.\, Automation & Robotics\n\n3.	Thu\, 29 September\, 4 pm: Tr
 avel sustainably – a reality? (Erasmus+ Green travel) with Nina Thiel\, 
 International Office\n\n4.	Thu\, 13 October\, 2.30 m: Inclusion on the r
 oad – this is how it can work (Erasmus+ Inclusion support) with Nicole S
 agmeister\, Gender& Diversity & Kerstin Kraus\, International Office\n\n
 \n\nZoomlink:  <https://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us/j/938508378?pwd=T2Y5Nl
 lsWjRIaENXcFhWdGVoWUlsZz09> https://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us/j/93850870
 378?pwd=T2Y5NllsWjRIaENXcFhWdGVoWUlsZz09\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2.	Interonal co-
  worker meeting (mandatory registration)\n\n\n\n\n\n	\n\n		\n\n\n UAS Te
 chnikum Wien aims at internationalizing the campus by welcoming internat
 ional staff members. The International Office cordially invites all staf
 f members to the first international co-worker meeting on October 14th f
 rom 12-2 p.m to our Social Space B6.05. The informal meeting provides th
 e room for (inter)national staff to exchange on topics such as their sta
 rt at the UAS Technikum Wien\, navigating your way through a new country
  etc. Lunch will be provided.\n\n\n\nPlease register for this event unti
 l at latest Ocber 5th:  <https://www.technikum-wien.at/international-co-
 worker-meeting/> https://www.technikum-wien.at/international-co-worker-m
 eeting/\n\n\n\n \nIf you have any questions please do not hesitate to co
 ntact us.\n\n\n\nBestishes!\n\n\n\nInternational Office | Internationale
 s Büro\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nchschule Technikum Wien | \n\nUniversity of Appli
 ed Sciences Technikum Wie\nHoechstaedtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\, AUSTRIA \n\n
 \n\nE:  <mailto:internationaoffice@technikum-wien.at> international.offi
 ce@technikum-wien.at \n\n\n\nI:<http://www.technikum-wien.at> www.techni
 kum-wien.at
