 iversities all over Austria\\r\ncompete to collect the most donaions.\\r
 \n\\r\n \\r\n\\r\nWhen:                 27.03.2023                     2
 :00 – 15:00 and\\r\n16:00 – 18:00\\r\n\\r\nWhere                 FHTW   
