DESCRIPTION:Dear All\,\n\n\n\nMany thanks firstly to Manfred for putting
  usll in touch - and my apologies again for any confusion that I may hav
 e caused with my enthusiasm! \n\n\n\nWe can certainly meet next Friday w
 hen both nna and Päivi can attend. Might I suggest 10:00CET / 11:00EET? 
 I can send out a zoom link if that works for everybody?\n\n\n\nI am atta
 ching some mordetailed information on the project objectives and activit
 ies\, as well as the proposed grant allocation per partner / per work pa
 ckage. Hopefully this will provide a little more context and background 
 to the project and the kind of role that UAS Lapland might be able to pl
 ay.\n\n\n\nI am very much oking forward to working with you.\n\n\n\nBest
  wishes from Vienna\,\n\nPau￼\n\n\n\nPaul Talbot\, B.A. (Hons)\, M.Sc.\n
 \nSenior Lecturer and Researc\n\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKo
 mpetenzfeld Sprachen\n\n \n\nFH nikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wi
 en\n\n+43 664 889 609 64\n\ntalboechnikum-wien.at \n\nwww.technikum-wien
 .at \n\n\n\n￼\n\nFachhochschule Tekum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 074476426\n\n\n\n
