DESCRIPTION:Le Mercredi\, Avril 03\, 2024 15:46 CEST\, Mark Adams <adams
 @technikum-wien.at> a écrit:\\r\n  \\r\nDear all\,\\r\nSome of you have 
 a panexam (Kommissionelle) for English. This has been scheduled for\\r\n
 Date: 23rdApril\,\\r\nTime: 16:10 - 17:40Dear Mark Adams\, \\r\nI hope t
 his email recee you well and I want to tell you that I need to take a pa
 nel exam. Therefore\, I kindly request you to create me a panel exam ( K
 ommissionelle). Thank you for considering my request and I am waiting fo
 r a positive response.\nBest regards\\r\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\,\\r\n 
 Leonel Kengo\\r\n Studen. Semester\\r\n Bachelor-Studiengang Mechatronik
 /Robotik\\r\nWhere: EDV F2.0\\r\nIf you require a panel exam\, please ma
 ke sure to contact your teacher rom last semester and let them know so t
 hat they create an exam for you.-- \\r\nBest regards\,\\r\n\\r\nMark Ada
