 e free checked bags weighing a \n\n> combined total of 69kg (150lb). Che
 cked baggage can be purchased based \n\n> on the following bag weight li
 mits:\n\n> 	20kg (44lbs) 	25kg (55lbs) 	23kg (50lbs) 	30kg (66lbs)\n\n> 
