DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\n\n \n\nHope your summer is going well ☀\n\nHere
 ’s a link to “CHANGING ENGLISHES”\, a free online course offered by York
  St. John University and supported by the British Council.  This course 
 was brought to my attention by elc in Frankfurt\, where we purchase some
  of the materials for our courses at FHWien that include elements of int
 ercultural competence (e.g. ICC\, EGW). I haven’t done the online course
  myself yet\, but it looks quite compact and helpful. Perhaps some of yo
 u will find it useful.\n\n \n\nHave a great weekend.\n\n \n\nCath\n\n \n
 \nCatherine Prewett-Schrempf\, MSc TESOL\n\nHead of Competence Center fo
 r Business English\n\n \n\nDepartment of Management\n\n\nFHWien der WKW\
 n\nUniversity of Applied Sciences for Management & Communication\n\nWähr
 inger Gürtel 97\,\n\n1180 Wien / Vienna\, Österreich / Austria\n\nT: +43
  690 40476 005\n\nT: +43 (1) 476 77 5807\n\n\ncatherine.prewett@fh-wien.
 ac.at \nwww.fh-wien.ac.at\n\n \n\n \n\nFHW Fachhochschul-Studiengänge Be
 triebs- und\nForschungseinrichtungen der Wiener Wirtschaft GmbH\nHG Wien
 \, FN 141443f\, ATU 42913406
