BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230809T072746Z
DESCRIPTION:And now with the attachment….\\r\n￼\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nDear All\,
 \\r trust you have been enjoying - and continue to enjoy - the summer br
 eak.\\rn\\r\nOver recent months\, we have been reworking parts of the Te
 chnical Engish course - which\, for some of us\, already kicks off in ar
 ound 4 weeks.\n\\r\nThe most important changes are in the concept and de
 sign of the self-tudy modules. We have also reworked the mode of assessm
 ent and the assessment criteria.\\r\nOur focus here has been on making t
 he course more relevant or students with different technical interests a
 nd on providing more incentive to engage (and appropriate recognition to
  those who do work hard).\\r\nnA point to note is that the self-study mo
 dules are far more content rich than previously - this looks\, therefore
 \, like a significantly higher workload for the students. \\r\nHowever\,
  the purpose of this is to provide a greter challenge to ‘better’ or ‘mo
 re diligent’ students. Students who do not engage with all of the self-s
 tudy are still likely to pass the course\, but only with 3s and 4s. Stud
 ents who really want to challenge themselves and strive for higher grade
 s will need to have really engaged with the material we provide them.\\r
 \n\\r\nTo bring you up-to-speed with these change\, I have prepared a ha
 ndbook for lecturer’s (attached) which I would encourage you to look thr
 ough. The Quellkurs is also available to view (but do not import anythin
 g yet as further formal/cosmetic changes are forthcoming).\\r\n\\r\nNo d
 oubt there will be more questions than answers at this point\,o I would 
 like to invite you to join us for an online Q&A session on Monday 28th A
 ugust at 18:00-19:30.\\r\n\\r\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/j/87528329551?p=b
 2tGVnhSMXNWR1ZLOU1pZk03ZkZJUT09 \\r\nMeeting ID: 875 2832 9551\\r\nPassc
 ode427575\\r\n\\r\nVery much looking forward to seeing you all soon.\\r\
 n\\r\nBesthes\,\\r\nPaul\\r\n\\r\nPaul Talbot\, B.A. (Hons)\, M.Sc.\\r\n
 Senior Lecturer aesearcher\\r\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\\r\nKom
 petenzfeld Sprachen\\r\nFH Technikum Wien\\r\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wi
 en\\r\n+43 664 889 609 6ntalbot@technikum-wien.at \\r\nwww.technikum-wie
 n.at \\r\n\\r\n￼\\r\nFachhochle Technikum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 074476426
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230828T193000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230828T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20230828T155021Z
SEQUENCE:0
