DESCRIPTION:Greetings Prof. Adams\,\n\n\n\nplease excuse my late respons
 e\, returned home this night from a workcontract i had to take due to fi
 nancial reasons. I already edited some of the highlighted sections in my
  paper a while ago but am unsure about the rest of them. Could we arrang
 e a short meeting to discuss the remaining problems so i can finalize th
 e paper for you? The choice of the date and time is solely yours as I am
  available 24/7 for the next two weeks.\n\n\n\nBest wishes\n\n\n\nManuel
  Wal
