DESCRIPTION:Hi Mr. Adams\,\n\n\n\nI could meet up before 15:30 on this f
 riday\, would 15:00 be possible for you to meet?\n\nThank you in advance
 .\n\n\n\nBest regards\,\n\nSüheyla Kübra Krasniqi BIW\n\n​​​​​\n\nAm Mit
 twoch\, März 30\, 2022 16:34 CEST\, schrieb Mark Adams <adams@technikum-
 wien.at>:\n\n Hi Kübra\,\n\n\n\nSorry this Friday I have to leave Techni
 kum at 15:30. If you can make it\n\nbefore then\, we can chat. If no\, t
 hen next week on Wednesday in the\n\nevening for example would work.\n\n
 \n\n\n\nOn 30/03/2022 16:31\, Sueheyla Kuebra Krasniqi wrote:\n\n> Hello
  Mr. Adams\,\n\n>\n\n> Thank you for your quick respond. If it is possib
 le for you\, I would\n\n> like to meet on friday the 1st before 16.55.\n
 \n> Thank you in advance.\n\n>\n\n> Best regards\n\n> Süheyla Kübra Kras
 niqi BIW\n\n>\n\n> Am Mittwoch\, März 30\, 2022 16:09 CEST\, schrieb Mar
 k Adams\n\n> <adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n>> Hi Kübra\,\n\n>>\n\n>> Tha
 nks for getting in touch. I would like to meet up with you to discuss\n\
 n>> the exam and help you as much as possible. Would you have time to me
 et\n\n>> up? We could then go through the exam and work on the mistakes 
 etc.\n\n>> together so you know what to watch out for.\n\n>>\n\n>> I am 
 mostly around on Wednesdays and on Fridays before your lessons\, so\n\n>
 > if you wanted to come on one of those days we could talk about it.\n\n
 >>\n\n>> Please let me know.\n\n>>\n\n>>\n\n>> On 30/03/2022 15:32\, Sue
 heyla Kuebra Krasniqi wrote:\n\n>> > Dear Mr. Adams\,\n\n>> >\n\n>> > I 
 hope you are doing well and enjoy your day. Some questions came to\n\n>>
  > my mind\, so I wanted to get in touch with you.\n\n>> > I have receiv
 ed an email about the panel exam that I have to attend.\n\n>> > Could yo
 u please give me information about the process of the panel\n\n>> > exam
 ? I would also appreciate\, If I you can send me a picture of my\n\n>> >
  exam. I would like to see my grade and the mistakes that I made \,so I\
 n\n>> > can work on them. On the other hand\, I want to ask you for some
  tipps&\n\n>> > tricks for the upcoming exam.\n\n>> > Thank you in advan
 ce.\n\n>> >\n\n>> > Best regards\,\n\n>> > Süheyla Kübra Krasniqi BIW\n\
 n>> >\n\n>> > ​​​​​\n\n>>\n\n>> --\n\n>> Best regards\,\n\n>>\n\n>> Mark
  Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n\n>> Entrepreneurship & Communications\n\n>> Kompe
 tenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\n>> Fachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\n>>\n\n>>
  Höchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\n>> T: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n\n>> E: m
 ark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\n>> I: www.technikum-wien.at\n\n>\n\n>\n\n
 >\n\n--\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n\nEntrepreneu
 rship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\nFachhochschul
 e Technikum Wien\n\n\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\nT: +43 (0)1 33
 34077-823\n\nE: mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI: www.technikum-wien.at
 \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n 
