 >  \n\n\n\n To:  Mark Adams [2]<adams@technikum-wien.at>   \n\n\n\nHi Ma
 rk\,\n\n\n\nthanks for this. I will make the adjustments.\n\n\n\nYesterd
 ay's BEE2A students pointed out to me that the link to the diversity\n\n
 worksheet in Self-Study A instructions does not work for them (I can acc
 ess\n\nit). I'm not sure how to best solve this problem.\n\n\n\nBest\,\n
 \nGaby\n\n\n\nAm Mittwoch\, Februar 16\, 2022 13:06 CET\, schrieb Mark A
 dams\n\n[3]<adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n   Hi Everybody\,\n\n\n\nSo it 
 seems the discord server link has expired. It is always only valid\n\nfo
 r 1 week which I did not know. Here is a new link that is not time\n\nse
 nsitive. Please change this on your 2nd semester courses.\n\n\n\n[4]http
