 > >> >\\r\n>> >> > Dear Mr. Martin \,\\r\n>> >> > It is t that\, I lost 
 my mother\, my two sisters\, and my brother in the earthquake\, and only
  my father was left\, and until now he cannot walk. Ja it is very devast
 ating.\\r\n>> >> > Thank you very much.\\r\n>> >> > Sincerely\,\\r\n>> >
