 he first draft of our ideas. See below and in attachment. \n\n\n\n \n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n--- Forwarded Message -------- \n\n\n\n\n\nSubject: \n\n\n\nSSS
  Einreichung Englisch) 1er Fassung\n\n\n\n\n\nDate: \n\n\n\nThu\, 23 Feb
