DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\n\n\n\nWednesday and Friday morning would both work 
 fore so whatever works better for you is fine by me. I've seen that you 
 work at FH Technikum Wien. Shall we meet there? (I live in the 20th dist
 rict\, it is just a few tram stops away.....) \n\n\n\nSee you\,\n\nSilvi
 a\n\n\n\n---prüngliche Nachricht-----\n\nVon: Mark Adams <adams@techniku
 m-wien.at> \nesendet: Dienstag\, 29. August 2023 09:31\n\nAn: Silvia Jex
 enflicker <silvi.jexenflicker@aon.at>\n\nBetreff: Re: AW: Touching base\
 n\n\n\nHI\n\n\n\nHout coffee on Wednesday or Friday morning next week? W
 ould anything work for you there?\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 16.08.23 16:41\, Silvia 
 Jexenflicker wrote:\n\n> ark\,\n\n>\n\n> Nice to hear from you - and sor
 ry about the late reply.\n\n> I agree it would be a good idea to meet up
  before the course starts. I start teaching (at FHWN) at the beginning o
 f September but only have a few classes in the first two weeks so it sho
 uld be easy to find a suitable time slot.\n\n>\n\n> See you then\,\n\n> 
 Silvia\n\n>\n\n> -----Ursprüngliche Naht-----\n\n> Von: Mark Adams <adam
 s@technikum-wien.at>\n\n> Gesendet: Monta\, 14. August 2023 07:43\n\n> A
 n: JEXENFLICKER Silvia <silvia.jexenflicker@eu.fh-wien.ac.at>\n\n> Betre
 ff: Touching base\n\n>\n\n> Hi Silvia\,\n\n>\n\nk Adams here\, co teache
 r on the FH Wien course in September. I just wanted to touch base with y
 ou\, as I don't think we have met yet. Would you want to meet before the
  class starts\, maybe the first week in September sometime\, once we hav
 e been given the course? Either that or we just catch up on the first da
 y of the course. Also good.\n\n>\n\n> Hope you are enjoying yousummer.\n
 \n>\n\n> --\n\n> Best regards\,\n\n>\n\n> Mark Adams\, M.A. O.D.EEntrepr
 eneurship & Communications\n\n> Kompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\n>\n Fac
 hhochschule Technikum Wien\n\n> Höchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\n> T+43
  (0)1 3334077-823\n\n> E: mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\n> I: www.techn
 um-wien.at\n\n>\n\n> Diese E-Mail ist vertraulich und kann rechtlich ges
 chzte Informationen beinhalten. Sollten Sie diese E-Mail irrtümlich erha
 lten haben\, ist jede Offenlegung\, Weitergabe oder sonstige Verwendung\
 , auch teilweise\, nicht gestattet. In diesem Fall ersuchen wir Sie\, un
 s per Antwort-Mail umgehend zu verständigen und die E-Mail (einschließli
 ch angeschlossener Dateien) zu vernichten. Danke!\n\n>\n\n> This e-mail 
 is confidentiaand may contain privileged information. If you are not the
  intended recipient of this message\, you are not authorized to disclose
 \, disseminate or use this message in any way. If you have received this
  message by mistake\, please inform the sender immediately and delete th
 is e-mail and its attachments. Thank you!\n\n>\n\n-- \n\nBest regards\,\
 n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.DEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompete
 nzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\n  \nchhochschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtpl
 atz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\nT: +43 (1 3334077-823\n\nE: mark.adams@technikum-
 wien.at\n\nI: www.technikum-wien.
