DESCRIPTION:Dear José\,\n\n\n\nThank you so much for your very prompt re
 spse. I am delighted you are onboard! \n\n\n\nI would be available on Fr
 iday th from around 13:30 CET. \n\nNext week I am travelling - but could
  schedul a meeting if the 13th doesn’t work - otherwise I am available a
 gain from the 25th of January.\n\n\n\nIndeed it would be superb to invol
 ve your collgue\, if they are available. My colleagues Mark Adams and Da
 vid Warren (in CC) may also wish to participate\, should we find a mutua
 lly convenient appointment.\n\n\n\nMany thanks and I look forward to spe
 aking with you soon.\n\nAll the best\,\n\nPaul\n\n\n\n\n\n> On 11.01.202
 3\, at 00:47\, José MaRibeiro Baptista <baptista@utad.pt <mailto:baptist
 a@utad.pt>> wrote:\n\n> n> Dear Paul\,\n\n> \n\n> thank you for your con
 tact which deserved my bestttention.\n\n> \n\n> Regarding participation 
 in this Erasmus+ project propol\, I am available to collaborate on it. T
 he proposed topic concerning the strengthening of communication for engi
 neers in the context of the energy transition is very interesting and fi
 ts with the research that I am currently developing with other colleague
 s in this fiel. \n\n> We can schedule a meting for next Thursday or Frid
 ay or next week. If you find it opportune\, I can invite a colleague who
  works in the field of saving water resources and sustainable buildings.
 \n\n> \n\n> Best regards!\n\n> \n\n> -- \n\n> Joséista (Assistant Profes
 sor with Habilitation)\n\n> https://www.cienciavitae.t/portal/en/531E-39
 D6-8000 <https://www.cienciavitae.pt/portal/en/531E-39D6-8000>\n\n> http
 s://orcid.org/0000-0003-0297-4709 <https://orcid.org/0000-003-0297-4709>
 \n\n> UTAD University- Engineering Department\, Ed II\n\n> Quia de Prado
 s\n\n> 5001-801 Vila Real\, PORTUGAL\n\n> \n\n> ------------------------
 ----------------------\n\n> Researcher at INESC Technology and Sciene - 
 INESC-TEC - Associate Laboratory\n\n> CPES-Center for Power and Energy y
 stems <https://www.inesctec.pt/en/centres/cpes>\n\n> Email: baptista@uta
 d.t <mailto:baptista@utad.pt>\n\n> Phone: 00351 259 350 343\n\n> Fax: 00
 351 2 350 300\n\n> Guest Editor of Special Issue: <https://www.mdpi.com/
 journal/nergies/special_issues/Power_Quality_of_Renewable_Energy_Source_
 Systems>   <https://www.mdpi.com/journal/energies/special_issues/Power_Q
 uality_of_Renewable_Energy_Source_Systems> Power Quality of Renewable En
 ergy Source Systems <https://www.mdpi.com/journal/energies/special_issue
 s/Power_Quality_of_Renewable_Energy_Source_Systems> <https://www.mdpi.co
 m/journal/energies/special_issues/Power_Quality_of_Renewable_Energy_Sour
 ce_Systems>\n\n> Guest Edtor of Special Issue:  <https://www.mdpi.com/jo
 urnal/energies/special_issues/EMS_and_REI>Energy Systems and Renewables 
  Integration in Buildings <https://www.mdpi.com/journal/energies/special
 _issues/EMS_and_REI>\n\n> De: tabot <talbot@technikum-wien.at <mailto:ta
 lbot@technikum-wien.at>>\n\n> Enviao: 10 de janeiro de 2023 21:17\n\n> P
 ara: José Manuel Ribeiro Baptista <batista@utad.pt <mailto:baptista@utad
 .pt>>\n\n> Assunto: Erasmus+ CooperationPartnership Project \n\n>  \n\n>
  Não costuma receber e-mails de talbot@tecikum-wien.at <mailto:talbot@te
 chnikum-wien.at>. Saiba por que motivo isto é importante <https://aka.ms
 /LearnAboutSenderIdentification>	\n\n> Dear Prf. José Manuel Ribeiro\,\n
 \n> \n\n> I am writing from the University of Apied Sciences Technikum V
 ienna (Department for Entrepreneurship and Communications)\, where I am 
 currently preparing a project proposal for an Erasmus+ Cooperation Partn
 ership. \n\n> \n\n> We are looking to develop a project tpromote interna
 tional communication skills for engineers in ‘green transition’ fields (
 renewable energies\, environmental engineering\, etc)\, with a particula
 r focus on helping engineers to collaborate internationally with researc
 h teams\, businesses and policymakers. Through the project we are hoping
  to establish a European Summer School on International Communication fo
 r Engineers. \n\n> \n\n> I know that the Technikum Wien cooperates closy
  with UTAD on various projects and we would be extremely keen to invite 
 the university to join the project consortium in this application! Our p
 roposed project may be particularly interesting to staff and students as
 sociated with topics of Environmental Sciences or Energy Engineering\, a
 lthough I am not sure who would be the best contact person for this spec
 ific field - our international office gave me your details because of yo
 ur close collaboration with our Electrical Engineering department. \n\n>
   \n\n> I am attachi a draft of our project concept. Should the project 
 be of any interest to you or your colleagues\, I would be delighted to a
 rrange an online meeting as soon as possible to discuss your ideas and t
 o set out any next steps.\n\n \n\n> Many thanks in advance for your cons
 ideration!\n\n> \n\n> Kind Regar\,\n\n> \n\n> Paul Talbot\n\n> \n\n>  \n
 \n> \n\n> ___\n\n> Paul Talbot\, MSntrepreneurship & Communications\n\n>
  Kompetenzfeld Sprachen\n\n> \n\n> Facchschule Technikum Wien\n\n> Höchs
 tädtplatz 6\n\n> 1200 Wien\n\n> \n\n> T3 660 3616 745\n\n> E: talbot@tec
 hnikum.at <mailto:talbot@technikum.at
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20230113T143000
