DESCRIPTION:Dear All\,\\r\n\\r\nI have put together a template for the q
 ualifations course in SS24 (which can also be used as a template for the
  FIT course).\\r\n\\r\nYou should be able to find it under test courses 
 (write accessand then testkurse zu LVs or here:\\r\n\\r\nhttps://moodle.
 technikum-wien.at/urse/view.php?id=24762#section-16￼\\r\n\\r\nI have als
 o started adding mateal\, although I am not yet finished. I was wonderin
 g if you had any good material relevant to the different blocks could yo
 u do the same over the next two weeks?\\r\n\\r\nGenerally\, as you will 
 see from the introduction to theourse\, the idea is to divide each teach
 ing unit into three: grammar\, content (that prepares the students for s
 ome way for first year English) and conversation. If you do have materia
 l if you could just upload it to the section where you think it might be
  relevant or\, failing that\, to the course material section at the begi
 nning of the course in the 'extra course material’ folder that would be 
 great.\\r\n\\r\nAny material on sentence structure articles\, nouns and 
 adjectives and also prepositions would be especially welcome as we are a
  bit short there.)\\r\n\\r\nAny questions\, please do get  touch (I shal
 l be around quite a bit over the next two weeks)\\r\n\\r\nThankou so muc
 h\,\\r\n\\r\nDavid\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nDavid Warren MA\\r\nDepartment of Entre
 rship & Communications\\r\nSenior Lecturer and Researcher\\r\n \\r\n\\r\
 nFachhohule Technikum Wien\\r\nHöchstädtplatz 5\, 1200 Wien\\r\nT: +43 6
 76 5011 9\nE: david.warren@technikum-wien.at\\r\nI: www.technikum-wien.a
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20240104T120000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
