BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240130T161054Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\,\\r\nThis is what I received in January (see attach
 ment. What do you think?\\r\n\\r\nThanks\,\\r\nCristina\\r\n\\r\nOn Tues
 day\, Januar\, 2024 08:33 CET\, Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at> wro
 te:\\r\n  \\r\nIthey were never there\, they go straight to a panel exam
  - attendance not achieved and the test failed. They do have to do the c
 ompensation work which will then be a basis for the discussion in the pa
 nel exam where everything about the course will be asked.\\r\nDo you kno
 w why he did not come to clas? Was he ill for an extended period? If not
 \, then I would not give any kind of extension as he created the problem
  himself. Simply not turning up and then expecting extensions and except
 ions and special treatment is beyond a joke.\\r\n On 30.01.24 00:52\, Cr
 istina Flitner wrote:Hi Paul\, Hi Mark\,n\\r\nI received this message fr
 om a student who attended just one class. Wht do you think I should do? 
 Also\, I am a bit confused about the retakes. If a student has never sho
 wn up and never contacted me\, they would go to the Panel Exam. Do stude
 nts who go to the Panel Exam have to do compensation work as well?\\r\n\
 \r\nAll the best\,\\r\nCristina\\r\n\\r\n-------- Original Me --------\\
 r\nSubject: Re: Compensation work deadline and tasks to complete y 31.01
 .24\\r\nDate: Thursday\, January 25\, 2024 22:49 CET\\r\nFrom: "Helmutos
 er" <ic23b113@technikum-wien.at>\\r\nTo: "Cristina Flitner" <flitner@tec
 hnkum-wien.at>\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nDear Mrs. Flitner\,\\r\n\\r\nThank you for 
 your messad the offer. I have completed the half of the self-study units
  in Word. And have a few questions regarding the class units. Furthermor
 e\, i would like to know\, in the hope that it is possible\, that the de
 adline for submission could be extended\, for example\, February 4th\, 2
 024? I have two more exams at the Fh next week and would like to utilize
  the time to adequately prepare for the tasks.\\r\n\\r\nI would greatly 
 appreciate it if you could gra me an extension.\\r\n\\r\nWith kind regar
 ds\,\\r\nHelmut Roser\\r\n   Dear Ht\,\\r\n\\r\nI just spoke to the dire
 ctor of the English program and he told  that you would need to complete
  all the self-study work in the course as well as any written paragraphs
  we did in class by the 31 of January and sent to me by email by 31.01.2
 4. Then\, the designers of the course would meet with you for an oral re
 view of the material. This would be the extent of the compensation work.
 \\r\n\\r\nPlease confirm by writing that and if you agreto these terms a
 nd I will send you the additional writing tasks to complete.\\r\n\\r\nAl
 l the best\,\\r\nCF\\r\n\\r\nOn Tuesday\, January 09\, 2024 14:40 C"Helm
 ut Roser" <ic23b113@technikum-wien.at> wrote:\\r\n Sehr geehrte Frau Flt
 ner\, sehr geehrte Frau Dostal\,\\r\n\\r\nich bin leider am Wochenende K
 rangeworden und übermittle Ihnen die Krankmeldung im Anhang.\\r\n\\r\nMi
 t freunchen Grüßen\,\\r\n\\r\nHelmut Roser\\r\n\\r\n \\r\n\\r\n \\r\n --
  \\r\nBest r\n\\r\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\\r\nEntrepreneurship & Commu
 nications\\r\nKompnzfeldleitung Sprachen\\r\n\\r\nFachhochschule Technik
 um Wien\\r\nHöchstädtpz 6\, A-1200 Wien\\r\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-5178\\r\
 nE:mark.adams@technikum-wieat\\r\nI:www.technikum-wien.at\\r\n\\r
