DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\,\n\n\n\nI'm sorry for my late answer.\n\n\n\nThe ne
 xt Tuesday March 8th at around 2 p.m. would be fine for me. I'm in the o
 ffice by then (and my lesson starts at 2:30 p.m.)\n\n\n\nHave a nice wee
 kend\,\n\n\n\n----------------------------------------------------------
 ------\n\nDipl.-Ing.(FH) Bernhard Wallisch\n\nUniversity of Applied Scie
 nces Technikum Wien \n\nHoechstaedtplatz 6\, 1200  Vienna\, AUSTRIA\n\nM
 : +43 670 6067000\n\nE: walliscb@technikum-wien.at\n\nI: http://www.tech
 nikum-wien.at\n\n-------------------------------------------------------
 --------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-----Ursprüngliche Nachricht-----\n\nVon: Mark A
 dams <adams@technikum-wien.at> \n\nGesendet: Donnerstag\, 3. März 2022 0
 9:08\n\nAn: Bernhard Wallisch (FHTW) <walliscb@technikum-wien.at>\n\nBet
 reff: English Classroom Support\n\n\n\nHi Bernhard\,\n\n\n\nFirst\, let 
 me say thank you for letting come to your lesson. It was very interestin
 g to watch.\n\n\n\nI would like to give you some feedback on your Englis
 h\, which was excellent by the way. Could we arrange a Zoom meeting mayb
 e\, or you let me know when you are in the Technikum and we could meet f
 or 10 minutes before a lesson or something like that?\n\n\n\nLet me know
  what works best for you.\n\n\n\n--\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\
 , M.A. O.D.E.\n\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitu
 ng Sprachen\n\n  \n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\,
  A-1200 Wien\n\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n\nE: mark.adams@technikum-wien.
 at\n\nI: www.technikum-wien.at
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220308T143000
