DESCRIPTION:Greetings Mark and Philipp!\n\n\n\n\n\nHere is the program f
 or  CIP project week in Kemi. Topics of the lectures will be determined 
 when the groups have selected the topics (we agreed that 3 topics will s
 tart).\n\n\nThere is now the hybrid CIP sessions in Monday\, Thursday an
 d Wednesday(total of 6-7 x 45min sessions) according to the timetables i
 nformed by Florian.\n\n\n\nI will make a separate list of these times an
 d add them to theASTW Moodle ( to the CIP lecture times PDF). I will als
 o present these times in next week´s start-up ZOOM session.\n\n\n\nGreat
  to see you in Kemi! Wl be a nice hybrid CIP week!\n\n\n\n\n\nBest wishe
 s\,\n\n\n
