DESCRIPTION:Dear colleagues\,\n\n\n\ndue to a misunderstanding\, the dat
 e othe coffee-Session is a few days off- it should have been Tuesday\, t
 he 29th of November.\n\n\n\nSince there is another Coffee-Session at thi
 s time kn: Would it be possible for you\, to attend the session alternat
 ively on Thursday\, the 1st of December (8:45-09:30)?\n\nOtherwise I wil
 l offer anotherdate in 2023.\n\n\n\nI am very sorry for the inconvenienc
 e!\n\n\n\nHave a nevening\,\n\nall the best\,\n\nSteffi\n\n\n\n-- \n\nSt
 efanie Lietze\, MScdent Support\n\nTeaching & Learning Center (TLC)\n\nF
 H Technikum Wien\n\nHstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\n\nR: B1.03\n\nT: +43 1 33
