DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\\r\nthank you very much for your reply\, it is a
  gret idea and I appreciate your \\r\ninterest in discussing some shared
  goals o vision on our cooperation\, even \\r\nyour willingness to visit
  our departmnt at STU in Bratislava. 23rd March is \\r\nperfect for our 
 meeting. I am teching on Thursday from 12:00 to 13:30 \\r\no'clock\, but
  I am avilable eithe before or after the classes\, if it is \\r\nconveni
 ent for you.\\r\nThank yoand I look forward to hearing from you.\\r\nKin
 d regards\,\\r\nMartina\\r\n\\rMgr. Martina Lipková\, PhD.\\r\n---------
 \\r\nStrojnícka fakulta STU v Bratlave\\r\nÚJŠ - Oddelenie jazykov a spo
 ločenských vied\\r\nNámestie slobo 17\\r\n812 31 Bratislava 1\\r\n\\r\nS
 lovak University of Technology in Bratisa\\r\nFaculty of Mechanical Engi
 neering\\r\nDepartment of Languages and SociaSciences\\r\nSlovak Republi
 c\\r\n\\r\nOn Thu\, 9 Mar 2023 11:28:57 +0000\, Mardams <adams@technikum
 -wien.at> wrote:\\r\n  Dear Ms. Lipková (Dear Martina)\,\\r\n  \\r\n  Th
 ank you very much for reaching out. I would be extremely intested in\\r\
 nmeeting and chating to see if there are any possibilities for u to work
 \\r\ntogether in the future. I know that everything works easily wit Zoo
 m etc but\\r\nI was wondering if what you thought of me coming to Bratis
 ava for our\\r\nmeeting? I would\, for example\, be available on 23rd or
  24t March if anything\\r\nworked for you there. As it is only an hour o
 r so awa\, it is not a problem.\\r\nLet me know what you think\, but we 
 can of cours also just Zoom if you prefer.\\r\n  \\r\n  \\r\n  \\r\n  \\
 r\n  On 07.03.23 14:Martina Lipková wrote:\\r\n> Dear Mr. Adams\,\\r\n> 
 I am writing to you witheference to an email I have received from Mr.Krs
 tic \\r\n>on 24 February. AsI know that he is teaching at the UAS Techni
 kum Wien\, I \\r\n>asked him fora favour to provide me with some informa
 tion on teaching foreign \\r\n>languges at your university\, as well as 
 who is responsible for teaching \\r\n>laguages at your institution. So\,
  I am glad to know that it is possible to \n>contact you in order to exp
 ress my interest in potential cooperation with the \\r\n>Language Compet
 ence Center at the UAS Technikum Wien. I am a hea of the \\r\n>Departmen
 t of Languages and Social Sciences at the Faculty of echanical \\r\n>Eng
 ineering of the Slovak University of Technology (STU) in ratislava\, and
  I \\r\n>would be grateful if we could discuss some mutual gols or the e
 xchange of \\r\n>experience\, if it is possible.\\r\n> Thank you vy much
  and in case of any questions do not hasitate to contact \\r\n>me. I wll
  be glad to answer your questions.\\r\n> I look forward to hearing from 
 yo.\\r\n> Best wishes\,\\r\n> Martina Lipková\\r\n>\\r\n>\\r\n> Mgr. Mar
 tina Lip\, PhD.\\r\n> ---------\\r\n> Strojnícka fakulta STU v Bratislav
 e\\r\n> ÚJŠ ddelenie jazykov a spoločenských vied\\r\n> Námestie slobody
  17\\r\n> 812  Bratislava 1\\r\n>\\r\n> Slovak University of Technology 
 in Bratislava\\r\n> ulty of Mechanical Engineering\\r\n> Department of L
 anguages and Social Scieces\\r\n> Slovak Republic\\r\n>\\r\n>\\r\n>   --
 - the forwarded message follow-\\r\n  \\r\n  --\\r\n  Best regards\,\\r\
 n  \\r\n  Mark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\\r\nepreneurship & Communications\\r\
 n  Kompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\\r\n  \\r\nFhochschule Technikum Wien\\
 r\n  Höchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\\r\n  T: +430)1 3334077-5178\\r\n  E
 :mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\\r\n  I:www.technikum-wn.at
