 -wien.ac.at/moodle/course/view.php?id=32503 at midnight. With that acces
 s\, please come to the computer lab B536 and do your exam there. My coll
 eague Catherine Prewett-Schrempf will be there and invigilate.\n\n\n\nAl
 l you are going to need that day are your login credentials for MOODLE\,
  your student ID and perhaps a bottle of water or a pen. And while I am 
