 t the exam a little early – the exam will start and finish automatically
  on time.\n\n\n\nThat’s it for now\, if you have any quick questions\, I
  can answer them early next week. Until then\, I hope are having a good 
 start of the semester.\n\n\n\nKind regards\,\n\n\n\nSimon Feher-Lehrner\
