CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20210514T080716Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\n\n \n\nWe are writing to you concerning your co
 nference booking which you have\nagreed to be deferred to our 55th Inter
 national IATEFL Conference to be held\nin Belfast in 2022.\n\n \n\nWe wa
 nted to let you know as soon as we could that we have needed to amend\nt
 he conference dates\, which have now been fixed at Tuesday 17 May to Fri
 day\n20 May 2022\, with Pre-Conference Events taking place on Monday 16 
 May 2022.\nWe do apologise for this exceptional change and any inconveni
 ence it might\ncause\, and hope that you are able to be available for th
 ese new dates just\nover a year away. There is nothing you need to do in
  terms of your booking\nand no other aspects of the conference have chan
 ged.\n\n \n\nWe ask that you reply to this email by Friday 28 May 2021 t
 o confirm you\nhave read and understood it and please do not hesitate to
  contact us if you\nhave any questions.\n\n \n\nKind regards\,\n\n \n\nI
 ATEFL Conference Team\n\n \n\nNo 2-3 The Foundry\, Seager Road\, Faversh
 am\, Kent\, ME13 7FD\, UK\nTelephone: +44 (0)1795 591414   |   Fax: +44 
 (0)1795 538951\nWeb: www.iatefl.org <http://www.iatefl.org/>    |   Emai
 l: info@iatefl.org\n<mailto:info@iatefl.org>    |   Social Media: #iatef
 l\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nRegistered as a Company in England and Wales 2531041.
  Registered as a\nCharity 1090853. This message is for the intended reci
 pient(s) only. If you\nhave received this message in error\, please noti
 fy the sender and delete it.\nIATEFL accepts no liability for loss or da
 mage caused by software viruses\nand you are advised to carry out a viru
 s check on any attachments contained\nin this message.
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220522T234500
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20220513T114500
LAST-MODIFIED:20220514T225315Z
SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:55th IATEFL Conference in Belfast
