DESCRIPTION:Hello Mark\, sorry for the late response\, if its still poss
 ible to make it on Wednesday morning would be fine for me.\n\n\n\nOn 28.
 05.22 at 09:20\, wrote Mark Adams adams@technikum-wien.at\n\n\n\nHi guys
 \,\n\n\n\nSo\, I am back after my conference in Ireland and can now arra
 nge your\n\nrepeat test for the English exam. I can offer you the follow
 ing dates.\n\nIt would be good if both of you could do it at the same ti
 me (the exam\n\nlasts 1.5 hours as before).\n\n\n\nTuesday\, June 7th be
 tween 14:00 and 21:00\n\n\n\nWed\, June 8th between 9:00 and 21:00\n\n\n
 \nThursday\, 9th June between 9:00 and 16:00\n\n\n\nWednesday 15th June 
 between 13:00 and 15:00\n\n\n\nFriday 17th June\, between 9:00 and 16:00
 .\n\n\n\nLet me know if something works for you in any of those times. I
  am not\n\nsure when you leave to go home which is why I gave so many da
 tes.\n\n\n\n--\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n\nEntr
 epreneurship&Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n\n\n\nFach
 hochschule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\nT: +43 (0
 )1 3334077-823\n\nE: mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI: www.technikum-wi
 en.at
