DESCRIPTION:Lieber Mark!\n\n\n\nAn so ein Event habe ich auch schon öfte
 rs gedacht\, lasse uns bitte damit aber nach Ostern sprechen.\n\n\n\nLie
 be Grüße\n\n\n\nMichi\n\n\n\n-----Ursprüngliche Nachricht-----\n\nVon: M
 ark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at> \n\nGesendet: Mittwoch\, 6. April 20
 22 11:38\n\nAn: Michael Windisch <windiscm@technikum-wien.at>\n\nBetreff
 : Social Evening for faculty\n\n\n\nHi Michi\,\n\n\n\nDavid and I were j
 ust discussing something we used to do for our department\, which was a 
 cocktail evening (David makes a mean Gimlet). We were wondering if it wo
 uld be a good idea to get us all together for a few drinks\, the faculty
  rather than the department alone. What do you think of bringing the who
 le faculty together some evening after work and socialising? David and I
  would organise it if there were a budget for it.\n\n\n\nLet me know wha
 t you think.\n\n\n\n--\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.
 \n\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen\n
 \nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\n\n\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\
 nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n\nE: mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI: www.te
 chnikum-wien.at
