CREATED:20240227T084052Z
DESCRIPTION:(English version below)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLiebe Kolleg*innen\,
 \n\n\n\n\nDas International Office darf auf zwei internationale Events h
 inwein\, die in der Woche vom 13-17. Mai an der FH Technikum Wien stattf
 inden.\nn\n\n \n\n\n\nWir veranstalten auch heuer wieder unsere Internat
 ional Week der wir folgende Hochschulen (Teilnehmer*innenanzahl in Klamm
 er) erwarten:\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*	Czech Technical University\, Czech Republi
 c (1)\n\n*	Hochse Hannover\, Germany (1)\n\n*	Hochschule Luzern\, Switze
 rland (6)\n\n*	JUNIUniversité Catholique de Lille\, France (4)\n\n*	Kett
 ering University\, US (1)\n\n*	Lapland University of Applied Sciences\, 
 Finland (5)\n\n*	Mid Swen University\, Sweden (1) \n\n*	Mongolian Univer
 sity of Science and Technolgy\, Mongolia  (3)\n\n*	South East Technologi
 cal University\, Ireland (3)\n*	Széchenyi István University\, Hungary  (
 1)\n\n*	Universidad de Jaén\, pain (1)\n\n*	University Transilvania of B
 rasov\, Romania (5)\n\n*	Universide de Trás-os-Montes e Alto Douro\, Por
 tugal (4)\n\n*	Université Savoie Mnt Blanc\, France (2)\n\n*	UNST Polite
 hnica Bucharest\, Romania (1)\n\n*	Zaeb University of Applied Sciences\,
  Croatia (3)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nZum selben punkt wickeln wir wieder zwei Er
 asmus+ Blended Intensive Programmes <https://erasmusplus.at/de/hochschul
 bildung/mobilitaet/blended-intensive-programmes>  (BIPs) vor Ort ab:\n\n
 \n\n \n\n\n\n*	Technological innovation to supporaching in sports and he
 alth (Partner: TU Chemnitz\, TU Brno)\n\n*	Technolog in a Smart Society 
 (Partner: Fontys\, Lapland UAS)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nDas Inttional Office läd
 t deshalb schon jetzt herzlich zur Teilnahme an folgenden Veranstaltunge
 n ein:\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*	Key notes und Sessions\n\n\n\n*	Mon. Mai: Keyno
 tes von 13.00 - 15.45 Uhr (F0.01)\n\n\n\n1.	Carina Zehetmaier\,EO und Gr
 ünderin von heartcore.ai and President of Women in AI Austria “Titel t.b
 .a”\n\n\n\n2.     Bernhard Knapp\, Studiengangsleiter Master Articial In
 telligence FHTW “ Sharing Insights Into National AI Training Material“\n
 \n\n\n3.     Patrick Link\, Professor für Produktmanagement\, Desn Think
 ing und Entrepreneurship an der Hochschule Luzern „Design thinking in th
 e age of AI”\n\n\n\n*	Dienstag und Mittwoch 14. und 15. Mai: Sessio von 
 9.00 - 13.00 Uhr (F0.01) \n\n\n\nIn den Sessions bringen die teilnehmeen
  Partnerhochschulen ihre Themen\, Expertise und Projekte im Bereich Gene
 rative AI ein\, u.a. zu \n\n\n\n“AI applications in power and energy sys
 te”\, “AI tools in the process of creating teaching material”\, “Applica
 tions of machine learning in industry: with a particular view in healthc
 are and financial environments”\, “How to Leverage the Power of Generati
 ve AI for Elevated Intrusion Detection and Cyberattacks in IoT Environme
 nts.”\, etc.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*	International fair: Teilnehmer*innen der 
 Inttional Week informieren über ihre Hochschulen\n\n\n\nMittwoch 15. Mai
  von .30 -16.30 Uhr (A Aula)\n\n\n\n*	Die Abschlusspräsentationen beider
  BIPs fden statt am:\n\n\n\nFreitag 17. Mai von 9.00 - 13.00 Uhr (F2.02)
  \n\n\n\\nEine Anmeldung ist nicht notwendig. Wir freuen uns auf zahlrei
 che Teilnahme!\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\n\n\n\nInternatio
 nal Offic\n\n\n**\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nDear colleagues\,\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nWe w
 ould like tor attention to two international events that will take place
  at UAS Technikum Wien in the week of May 13-17.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nWe are 
 organizing our Inttional Week again this year to which we expect the fol
 lowing institutions (number of participants in brackets):\n\n\n\n \n\n\n
 \n*	Czech Technical Univty\, Czech Republic (1)\n\n*	Hochschule Hannover
 \, Germany (1)\n\n*	Hochsche Luzern\, Switzerland (6)\n\n*	JUNIA Univers
 ité Catholique de Lille\, Frace (4)\n\n*	Kettering University\, USA (1)\
 n\n*	Lapland University of Appli Sciences\, Finland (5)\n\n*	Mid Sweden 
 University\, Sweden (1) \n\n*	Mongoan University of Science and Technolo
 gy\, Mongolia  (3)\n\n*	South East Tecnological University\, Ireland (3)
 \n\n*	Széchenyi István University\, Hunary  (1)\n\n*	Universidad de Jaén
 \, Spain (1)\n\n*	University Transilvaniaf Brasov\, Romania (5)\n\n*	Uni
 versidade de Trás-os-Montes e Alto Douro\, ortugal (4)\n\n*	Université S
 avoie Mont Blanc\, France (2)\n\n*	UNST Politnica Bucharest\, Romania (1
 )\n\n*	Zagreb University of Applied Sciences\, Coatia (3)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n
 \nAt the same time\, we are again running two ErasmBlended Intensive Pro
 grams <https://erasmusplus.at/de/hochschulbildung/mobilitaet/blended-int
 ensive-programmes>  (BIPs) on site:\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*	Tecogical innovati
 on to support coaching in sports and health (partners: TU Chemnitz\, TU 
 Brno)\n\n*	Technology in a Smart Society (partners: Fontys\, Laland UAS)
 \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nThe International Office therefore cordially inviyou to
  participate in the following events:\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*       Key notnd 
 sessions\n\n\n\n*       Monday\, May 13: Keynotes from 1 p.m. – 3.45 p. 
 (F0.01)\n\n\n\n1.       Carina Zehetmaier\, CEO and founder of heartcore
 . and President of Women in AI Austria “title t.b.a.” \n\n\n\n2.       B
 nhard Knapp\, Head of the Master Artificial Intelligence program UASTW "
  Sharing Insights Into National AI Training Material"\n\n\n\n3.       Pa
 trick nk\, Professor of Product Management\, Design Thinking and Entrepr
 eneurship at Lucerne University of Applied Sciences and Arts "Design thi
 nking in the age of AI"\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n*	Tuesday and Wednesday May 14 a
 nd 15: Sessionsm 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m. (F0.01) \n\n\n\nIn the sessions\,
  the participatingartner institutions will contribute their topics\, exp
 ertise and projects in the field of Generative AI\, including\n\n\n\n \n
 \n\n\n"AI applications iwer and energy systems"\, "AI tools in the proce
 ss of creating teaching material"\, "Applications of machine learning in
  industry: with a particular view in healthcare and financial environmen
 ts"\, "How to Leverage the Power of Generative AI for Elevated Intrusion
  Detection and Cyberattacks in IoT Environments."\, etc.\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\
 n*	International fair: International Wearticipants provide information a
 bout their institutions\n\n\n\nWednesday M 15 from 2.30 p.m.  - 4.30 p.m
 . (A Aula)\n\n\n\n*	The final presentations oboth BIPs will take place o
 n:\n\n\n\nFriday May 17 from 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p. (F2.02)\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\
 nNo registration needed. We are looking forward to rous participants!\n\
 n\n\n \n\n\n\nBest wishes\n\n\n\nInternational 
