BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240215T100942Z
DESCRIPTION:Eventuell für euch interessant 😉\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLG\n\n\n\n
 \n\n--\n\n\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen/ Kind regards\n\n\n\nMag. Nina Th\
 n\nProject- & Mobility Coordinator\, | Projekt- und Mobilitätskoordinati
 o\n\nStaff Mobility | Personalmobilität\n\nInternational Office | Intern
 atiales Büro\n\n\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien | University of Applie
 d Scices Technikum Wien\n\nHoechstaedtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\, AUSTRIA \n\n
 \n\nT: +1 333 40 77-3183\n\nF: +43 1 333 40 77-99323\n\nE: nina.thiel@te
 chnikum-wieat <mailto:nina.thiel@technikum-wien.at> \n\nI:  <http://www.
 technikum-wienat/> www.technikum-wien.at\n\n\n\nPlease consider the envi
 ronment before prting this email\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nVon: International Week
  <internationalweek@-smb.fr <mailto:internationalweek@univ-smb.fr> > \n\
 nGesendet: Montag\, 5. ebruar 2024 10:29\n\nAn: International Week <inte
 rnationalweek@univ-smb.fr mailto:internationalweek@univ-smb.fr> >\n\nCc:
  International Week <internatonalweek@univ-smb.fr <mailto:internationalw
 eek@univ-smb.fr> >\n\nBetreff: [taff Week] SMILE/Summer Modules in Inter
 cultural Languages Education\, Université Savoie Mont Blanc\, FRANCE\n\n
 \n\n \n\n\n\nDear all\, \n\n\n\nThe Uité Savoie Mont Blanc\, member of t
 he Unita Alliance\, is organizing its Staff Week "Summer Modules for Int
 ercultural and Language Education" (S.M.I.L.E) [in French "Semaine des L
 angues"] - from June 24 to 29\, 2024. \n\n\n.M.I.L.E is an amazing oppor
 tunity to 1) teach languages in France or 2) improve your language compe
 tences in the wonderful surroundings of the French Alps! \n\n\n\nOur off
 er covers the following modules: \n\n- French \n\n- Esh\n\n- Spanish\n\n
 - Italian\n\n- Intercomprehension in Romance languages\nIntercultural co
 mmunication\n\n\n\nModules are organized in Chambéry by ha-days\, leavin
 g time for intercultural activities and excursions organized in the surr
 oundings. \n\n\n\nYou will find all the detailed information : \n\n- on 
 the imotion page of SMILE <http://staffmobility.eu/staffweek/summe-modul
 es-intercultural-language-0> \n\n- on the SMILE catalogue <https://ww.un
 iv-smb.fr/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/smile-2024-pre-programme_compressed
 .pdf> \n\n\n\nAnd follow this link to register <https://usmb.moveonfr.co
 m/fm/659bfdf1893083e73d0cce4f/eng> ! \n\n\n\nBe mindful that although th
 e regirations are open until March 17th\, a selection may be made on a f
 irst come - first served basis in case the maximum capacity is reached. 
 Some groups are already almost complete\, so do not wait too long before
  you apply!\n\\nFor any further information request\, please do not hesi
 tate to contact our Direction of International Relations through: intern
 ationalweek@univ-smb.fr <x-msg://1/internationalweek@univ-smb.fr> .\n\n\
 n\nWe warmly encourage l of you to participate to our S.M.I.L.E programm
 e! \n\n\n\nWith kind regar\, \n\n\n\n-- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n.\n\n\n\
 n\n\nCélia MERIAS \n\nCoordiôle Partenariats Internationaux / Coordinato
 r of the International Partnership Unit \n\n\n\n\n\nDirection des Relati
 ons Internationales / 27 rue Marc- 73011 CHAMBERY cedex \n\n(Absente le 
 mercredi / Absent on Wednesdays) \n\n <https://www.facebook.com/UnivSavo
 ie> Facebook |  <https://twitter.com/Univ_Savoie> Twitter |  <https://ww
 w.youtube.com/channel/UCAxqzKFHSwPeaHe3Ams6YMw> Youtube |  <https://www.
 univ-smb.fr> www.univ-smb.fr
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20240223T130000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
