DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\n\n\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\nAs d
 isced on the phone with my colleague\, I would like to confirm I will or
 der the licences for Road to IELTS at the end of August.\n\n\n\nIf you h
 ave any qstions\, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nAll the best\
 n\nElena\nElena Roversi | Key Accounts Relationship Coordinator Austria 
 & Germany\n\nritish Council Austria | Siebensterngasse 21 | 1070 Vienna 
 | Austria\n\nElea.Roversi@britishcouncil.at<mailto:Elena.Roversi@british
 council.at>\n\nwww.ritishcouncil.org<http://www.britishcouncil.org/> | w
 ww.britishcouncil.at<http://www.britishcouncil.at/> | www.britishcouncil
 .de<http://www.britishcouncil.de/>\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/BritishCo
 uncilAustria | https://www.fcebook.com/BritishCouncilGermany\n\n\n\n**Up
 coming Public Holidays/leave: 205\, 8-9/06**\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Roversi\, 
 Elena (Austria)\n\nSent: Thursday April 2023 09:28\n\nTo: adams@techniku
 m-wien.at\n\nSubject: RE: ClarityEngsh program enquiry\n\n\n\nDear Mark\
 ,\n\n\n\nI hope this finds you well.\nk you for this\, just a quick info
  that we will send the offer to renew this licence soon.\n\n\n\nMany tha
 nks for your patience and best wishes\,\n\nEa\n\n\n\nElena Roversi | Key
  Accounts Relationship Coordinator Austria & Geany\n\nBritish Council Au
 stria | Siebensterngasse 21 | 1070 Vienna | Austri\n\nElena.Roversi@brit
 ishcouncil.at<mailto:Elena.Roversi@britishcouncil.at\nwww.britishcouncil
 .org<http://www.britishcouncil.org/> | www.britishcouncil.at<http://www.
