DESCRIPTION:Hello!\\r\n\\r\nYes I’m already a lot better\, thank you. Tu
 esd at 16:00 would work just fine for me!\\r\n\\r\nBest wishes\,\\r\n\\r
 \nOona Ki\n\\r\nGesendet von Outlook für iOS<https://aka.ms/o0ukef>\\r\n
 ______________________________\\r\nVon: ADAMS Mark <mark.adams@edu.fh-wi
 en.ac.at>\\r\nGeseet: Friday\, June 21\, 2024 9:14:38 AM\\r\nAn: KIRÁLY 
 Oona Sophia <oona.kirly@edu.fh-wien.ac.at>\; PREWETT-SCHREMPF Catherine 
 | FHWien der WKW <catherine.prewett@fh-wien.ac.at>\\r\nBetreff: Re: exam
 \\r\n\\r\n\\r\nHi Oona\,\\r\n\\r\\re you? Hope you are feeling better. W
 ould you be available to do the test next week? For example\, Tuesday af
 ternoon at 16:00 or Thursday anytime during the day before 16:00? Let me
  know what would work for you. We should have it done within two weeks a
 fter the date of the exam.\\r\n\\r\nLooking forwd to hearing from you so
 on.\\r\n\\r\nMark\\r\n\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nOn 17.06.24 10:08\,Y Oona Sophia wr
 ote:\\r\nDear Mark\,\\r\n\\r\nI have a pretty high fever and I not feeli
 ng well at all. I wanted to force myself to go to the exam today but I r
 eally can't go. I am very sorry for the inconvenience and I hope there i
 s a way for me to re-do the exam.\\r\n\\r\nThank you for your understand
 i\,\\r\n\\r\n\\r\nOona Kiraly\\r\n\\r\nGesendet von Outlook für iOS<http
 s://aka.ukef>
