DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\n\n\n\n​​​​I worked on the 1 of July while u was
  also at the office for 5 hours and managed to completed a great deal of
  work. I am now going to try and complete it in one day and will inform 
 you as soon as soon as I am done definately before the 26 July as stipul
 ated by Paul.\n\n\n\nBecause many topics on the research list are very r
 ecent a also many  products are abstract\, research cannot occur at the 
 click of one botton. Hence some topics require more time and searches th
 an others. In addition\, due to the fact that some products are abstract
 \, product descriptions are nearly non existant. Hence this as to be anl
 ed from different perspectives\, for example\, how the product is used o
 r what the benefits are. At times\, I found some content lacking in cert
 ain aspects and continued researching. The topic\, lighting\, for exampl
 e\, is so vast and I did not want to exclude crucial aspects ar complete
 ly leave out any forms of lighting. I always tried to ensure that the st
 udents receive optimal content. \n\n\n\nPaul expressed approval about th
 e first batch of work completed. \n\nI trust you find the above in order
 .\n\n\n\nBest regards.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nttwoch\, Juli 03\, 2024 12:04 CEST\,
  schrieb Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n Dear Krishne\,\n\n\n\
 nPlease let me know which days need to bemoved from your holiday plan\n\
 nso that I can inform HR. I have to admit thugh\, that I am a little\n\n
 disconcerted that the project took so many hour when you already had\n\n
 the 48 calculated into your previous plan. This ha now ended up with\n\n
 you having overtime that was defnitely not planned. Cn you please let\n\
 nme know why you needed approximately 70 hours for the tsk instead of\n\
 nthe less than 48 that were planned for it? This will help ith my\n\npla
 nning in future.\n\nThanks.\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 01.07.24 13:31\, KriReddy-Hris
 enko wrote:\n\n> Dear Mark\,\n\n>\n\n> Following on our short consation 
 this morning I thought to remind\n\n> you as you are so busy that th res
 earch needs 3 to 4 working days\n\n> more. As a result\, I have decidedt
 o take these days from my\n\n> "holidays" as the research must be comple
 te before 26 July. It will\n\n> require approximately 15 to 20 hours mor
 e. I m in the office working\n\n> today but did not cancel my holiday fo
 r today s I am awaiting your\n\n> instructions.\n\n>\n\n> Many thanks & 
 best regarn> Krishne\n\n\n\n--\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n\nMark Adams\, M.A
 . O.D.E.\n\nEeneurship & Communications\n\nKompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen
 \n\n\n\nFachhochule Technikum Wien\n\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\n\n
 T: +43 (0)1 33340-5178\n\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\nI:www.techni
 kum-wien.at\n\n \n 
