CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20240909T075551Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear All\,\nThank you for your feedback. The next ECO-GT jou
 r fixe meeting is scheduled for October 24th at 10:30 AM Warsaw time htt
 ps://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ODIwMTM2NDMtNTNjOC00
 ZjkyLWI1ZWQtY2I5YWZkM2E4Yjc2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22867
 60356-0022-486f-b793-a2d470bba5a5%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22b58983b3-1340-4bc4
 -804e-5ce148672441%22%7d\n\nThe topics to be discussed:\n\n  1.\nProject
  Progress - Paul\n  2.\nProgress report - comments - Maciej\n  3.\nConfe
 rence plan - all Partners\n  4.\nAdministration nad Finance - Maciej\n  
 5.\nDissemination - Maciej\n  6.\nMeeting in Istanbul - discussion\n\nWi
 th best regards\,\nMaciej\n\n\n\n________________________________\nOd: M
 aciej Sawicki <msawicki@pg.edu.pl>\nWysłane: piątek\, 6 września 2024 11
 :06\nDo: Maciej Sawicki <maciej.sawicki@pg.edu.pl>\; José Manuel Ribeiro
  Baptista <baptista@utad.pt>\; Emilia Bączkowska <emilia.baczkowska@pg.e
 du.pl>\; Paul Talbot <talbot@technikum-wien.at>\; Ana Cristina Briga de 
 Sá <anas@utad.pt>\; Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\; Anca Barsan <
 abarsan@unitbv.ro>\; Kantola Lauri <lauri.kantola@lapinamk.fi>\; E.Gözde
  Özbayram <gozde.ozbayram@istanbul.edu.tr>\; Jylhä Sanna <sanna.jylha@la
 pinamk.fi>\; Pikkarainen Ari <ari.pikkarainen@lapinamk.fi>\; Honka Päivi
  <paivi.honka@lapinamk.fi>\; Una Beagon <una.beagon@tudublin.ie>\; Steph
 en Harper <Stephen.Harper@TUDublin.ie>\; Katarzyna Jankowska <katarzyna.
 jankowska@pg.edu.pl>\nTemat: ODP: ECO-GT Progress report to be filled an
 d reviewed\n\nDear All\,\nI hope you had a wonderful holiday.\nCould you
  please fill in the doodle poll for our next ECO GT Jour Fixe meeting. W
 e suggest two days - either 17th or 24th of October https://doodle.com/m
 eeting/participate/id/b44Wyk0b\nWith best regards\,\nMaciej\n\n\n_______
 _________________________\nOd: Maciej Sawicki <maciej.sawicki@pg.edu.pl>
 \nWysłane: poniedziałek\, 24 czerwca 2024 13:40\nDo: José Manuel Ribeiro
  Baptista <baptista@utad.pt>\; Emilia Bączkowska <emilia.baczkowska@pg.e
 du.pl>\; Paul Talbot <talbot@technikum-wien.at>\; Ana Cristina Briga de 
 Sá <anas@utad.pt>\; Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\; Anca Barsan <
 abarsan@unitbv.ro>\; Kantola Lauri <lauri.kantola@lapinamk.fi>\; E.Gözde
  Özbayram <gozde.ozbayram@istanbul.edu.tr>\; Jylhä Sanna <sanna.jylha@la
 pinamk.fi>\; Pikkarainen Ari <ari.pikkarainen@lapinamk.fi>\; Honka Päivi
  <paivi.honka@lapinamk.fi>\; Una Beagon <una.beagon@tudublin.ie>\; Steph
 en Harper <Stephen.Harper@TUDublin.ie>\; Katarzyna Jankowska <katarzyna.
 jankowska@pg.edu.pl>\nTemat: ECO-GT Progress report to be filled and rev
 iewed\n\nDear All\,\nCould you please review the progress report\, add w
 hatever you think is necessary along with the comments ECO GT Progress r
 eport 140624.docx<https://fhtw.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/ECO-GTPlanning
 Group/Freigegebene%20Dokumente/General/2_Project%20Management%20and%20Me
 etings/5_Reporting/ECO%20GT%20Progress%20report%20140624.docx?d=w61d1671
 03e274aba9030ca8b90d278a2&csf=1&web=1&e=zlpOHA>. Could you please review
  this document by Thursday 11.00 a.m. at the very latest. I will also ne
 ed some time to put it together\, copy and paste into the reporting plat
 form.\nThank you in advance for your contribution :)\,\nMaciej\n21.06.20
 24 08:59 Maciej Sawicki <maciej.sawicki@pg.edu.pl> napisał(a):\n\n\nDear
  All\,\nThe link to the meeting at 9.00 CEST today is https://teams.micr
 osoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ODIwMTM2NDMtNTNjOC00ZjkyLWI1ZWQtY2I
 5YWZkM2E4Yjc2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2286760356-0022-486f
 -b793-a2d470bba5a5%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22b58983b3-1340-4bc4-804e-5ce148672
 441%22%7d\nRegards\,\nMaciej\n\n20.06.2024 13:32 Maciej Sawicki <maciej.
 sawicki@pg.edu.pl> napisał(a):\n\n\nDear All\,\nJust to remind about our
  Jour Fixe meeting tomorrow at 9.00 CEST. Since this is our last meeting
  before summer holidays we should discuss the following:\n- progress of 
 the project\, competency framework\, introduction to draft materials - P
 aul\,\n- progress report - Maciej.\n\nI also kindly ask you to upload si
 gned financial statement by the legal representatives to Signed financia
 l statements<https://fhtw.sharepoint.com/:f:/r/sites/ECO-GTPlanningGroup
 /Freigegebene%20Dokumente/General/2_Project%20Management%20and%20Meeting
 s/5_Reporting/Signed%20financial%20statements?csf=1&web=1&e=cBTfIb>. Ple
 ase upload all the supporting documents to 4_Supporting documents<https:
 //fhtw.sharepoint.com/:f:/r/sites/ECO-GTPlanningGroup/Freigegebene%20Dok
 umente/General/2_Project%20Management%20and%20Meetings/4_Supporting%20do
 cuments?csf=1&web=1&e=hDZeCF> in your folders.\n\nCould you also add you
  comments to the progress report ECO GT Progress report 140624.docx<http
 s://fhtw.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/ECO-GTPlanningGroup/Freigegebene%20D
