BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20241009T154304Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello Mr. Adams\,\n\nI wanted to ask if it is possible to re
 schedule our MGR first meeting? I have arranged a meeting via doodle on 
 October 18th at 3:30pm and unfortunately I can't make it. \nI have seen 
 that there are still free dates on Oct 17th\, unfortunately we already h
 ave a teaching event around that time. \n\nI wanted to ask if you would 
 have time next week in one of the following periods: \n- Tue\, 15.10 fro
 m 2pm-6pm\n- Wed\, 16.10 from 8am-6pm\n- Thu\, 17.10 from 8-9am or 5-6pm
 \n\nOtherwise\, I am also really flexible the week after (Mo\,21.- Fr\,2
 5.10). I only have lectures on Wed\, 23.10 from 8am to 2pm. \n\nKind reg
 ards\nCäcilia Werle 
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20241016T153000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20241016T150000
LAST-MODIFIED:20241009T154327Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Request to Reschedule MGR Meeting 1st Round
