DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr Adams\,\nUnfortunately I'm unable to attend at your 
 proposed meeting at 12 and therefore we should schedule it for next week
 .\nI'd be availabe on wednesday after 12 as well as thursday after 3PM\n
 Kind regards\,\nChristian Zidaru\n\nAm Dienstag\, November 12\, 2024 13:
 44 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <mark.adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nHi Chr
 istian\,\n\nUnfortunately Friday at 4:30 no longer works. I can offer to
 morrow at \n12\, otherwise it will have to be next week.\n\n\nOn 12.11.2
 4 10:54\, Christian Zidaru wrote:\n>\n> Dear Mr. Adams\n> I'm so sorry f
 or answering so late - your mail ended up in my spam folder.\n> Yes\, we
 dnesday works well for me!\n> Would 4:30 PM be a convenient time for you
 ?\n> Kind regards\,\n> Christian Zidaru\n>\n>\n> Am Dienstag\, November 
 05\, 2024 12:17 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams \n> <mark.adams@technikum-wien.
 at>:\n>\n>> Wednesday between 3 and 6?\n>>\n>>\n>> On 05.11.24 11:32\, C
 hristian Zidaru wrote:\n>> >\n>> > Dear Mr. Adams\,\n>> >\n>> > I apolog
 ize for reaching out only now. Unfortunately\, I haven’t been\n>> > able
  to make further progress on my Master’s thesis over the past few\n>> > 
 weeks. However\, I have prepared a proposal that I would like to review\
 n>> > with you. Would you have availability in calendar week 45 to sched
 ule\n>> > a meeting?\n>> >\n>> > Kind regards\,\n>> > Christian Zidaru\n
 >> >\n>> >\n>> > Am Dienstag\, Oktober 29\, 2024 10:31 CET\, schrieb Mar
 k Adams\n>> > <mark.adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n>> >\n>> >> Hi Everybody\
 ,\n>> >>\n>> >> I have not had the first meeting with you guys yet\, tho
 ugh I did get\n>> >> some emails. Can you please update me on the situat
 ion as it is \n>> now? If\n>> >> we do not have the first meeting\, then
  you cannot pass English.\n>> >> Obviously if there are reasons we can f
 ind a solution\, but I need to\n>> >> know what the status is and what i
 s going on. Please contact me \n>> with an\n>> >> update\, even if you h
 ave already written to me?\n>> >>\n>> >> Thanks.\n>> >>\n>> >> --\n>> >>
  Best regards\,\n>> >>\n>> >> Mark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n>> >> Entreprene
 urship & Communications\n>> >> Kompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen und Social 
 Skills\n>> >>\n>> >> Fachhochschule Technikum Wien\n>> >> Höchstädtplatz
  6\, A-1200 Wien\n>> >> T: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n>> >> E: mark.adams@tec
 hnikum-wien.at\n>> >> I: www.technikum-wien.at\n>> >>\n>> >\n>> >\n>> >\
 n>> -- \n>> Best regards\,\n>>\n>> Mark Adams\, M.A. O.D.E.\n>> Entrepre
 neurship & Communications\n>> Kompetenzfeldleitung Sprachen und Social S
 kills\n>>\n>> Fachhochschule Technikum Wien\n>> Höchstädtplatz 6\, A-120
 0 Wien\n>> T: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\n>> E: mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n
 >> I: www.technikum-wien.at\n>>\n>\n>\n>\n-- \nBest regards\,\n\nMark Ad
 ams\, M.A. O.D.E.\nEntrepreneurship & Communications\nKompetenzfeldleitu
 ng Social Skills and Communication\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\nHöc
 hstädtplatz 6\, A-1200 Wien\nT: +43 (0)1 3334077-823\nE: mark.adams@tech
 nikum-wien.at\nI: www.technikum-wien.at\n\n \n\n\n\n 
