BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20241126T155546Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi\,\nthanks for the reply. Wednesday morning at 9.00 works 
 for me well\nShould I cancel the meeting on 2nd December myself?\n \n\n\
 nAm Montag\, November 25\, 2024 09:34 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <mark.ada
 ms@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nHi Magdalena\, \n \nI can do Wednesday morn
 ing between 9 and 12 or in the afternoon from 2pm to 5 pm\, but the earl
 ier the better. \n \nLet me know what works for you.\n\n \nOn 23.11.24 1
 7:06\, Magdalena Eder wrote:\nDear Mr. Adams\,\n \nI hope this message f
 inds you well. I wanted to let you know that I have completed my paper a
 nd would like to ask if it might be possible to schedule our meeting for
  next week instead of the currently booked appointment on 2nd December\,
  which I would like to cancel.\n \nIf you are available next week\, I wo
 uld appreciate your time on one of the following dates: Monday\, 25th No
 vember\, Wednesday\, 27th November\, or Friday\, 29th November.\n \nThan
 k you very much in advance and  I look forward to hearing from you.\n \n
 Best regards\,\nMagdalena-- \nMark Adams\nKompetenzfeldleiter Social Ski
 lls and Communication\nFaculty of Electronic Engineering & Entrepreneurs
 hip\n\nFH Technikum Wien\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\nT: +43 1 333 40 
 77-5178\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien.at\nI:technikum-wien.at\n\nFachhoch
 schule Technikum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 074476426 \n \n\n\n\n 
