DESCRIPTION:Hi Mark\,\n\nI have requested meetings with the suspect stud
 ents\, all on 9th January - Kelly’s two students in the afternoon (toget
 her with Kelly and myself)\, and my BEE student at 11:20. Would you be a
 ble to join me for this 11:20 meeting? I think it’s important that there
  are always 2 people - the course lecturer\, plus one other.\n\nBest\, \
 nPaul \n\n\nPaul Talbot\, B.A. (Hons)\, M.Sc.\nSenior Lecturer / Researc
 her\nFaculty of Electronic Engineering & Entrepreneurship \nSocial Skill
 s and Communication\n \nFH Technikum Wien\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\
 n+43 664 889 609 64\ntalbot@technikum-wien.at \nwww.technikum-wien.at \n
 \n￼\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 074476426
