DESCRIPTION:Hi All\,\n \nJust a quick reminder of tomorrow's zoom Q&A se
 ssion about the new Business English course at 1700. I am looking forwar
 d very much to seeing those who can make it there!\n \nBE25 Q&A/Time: Ja
 n 23\, 2025 05:00 PM/Join Zoom Meeting https://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us
 /j/94108668210\n \nAlso\, please do feel free to contact me regarding an
 y questions you might have - for scheduling enquiries however it would b
 e best\, now the semester has already been planned\, to contact the rele
 vant study program assistant.\n \nBest\,\n \nDavid\n\n\n \n\n\n 
