BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250123T102218Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr. Adams\,\n \nAlso sorry for the late answer\, but I 
 have to work today and tomorrow. If it is possible next week\, that woul
 d be great. Next week I'm completely free besides Tuesday 13.00 and Wedn
 esday 15.00\, as I have two meetings at my workplace.\n\nIf it is to str
 essful for you or your schedule it is also okay\, as I already had my tw
 o meetings with you.\n\nThanks a lot\,\nPhilipp Wegscheider\n\nAm Dienst
 ag\, Januar 21\, 2025 18:04 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wi
 en.at>:\n\n \nHiSorry for the late reply. Was in Portugal with the fh al
 l week. Tomorrow there is now a slot at 11 think\, maybe 11.30 in termin
 o.AColleague dropped out. Check it out if you have time and if not we fi
 nd something else. Let me know. Sent from my iPhone\n\n \nOn 15.01.2025\
 , at 12:38\, Philipp Wegscheider <gr23m010@technikum-wien.at> wrote:\n\n
  \nDear Mr. Adams\,\n\nI already had my first and second meeting with yo
 u\, but we talked about a possible third meeting\, as I'm presenting the
  current state of my thesis in February. You told me to get in touch wit
 h you to arrange another appointment\, as all available spots for next w
 eek are already booked.\n\nAs I'm currently working on my paper\, do you
  maybe have another free spot next week to discuss my paper? From my sid
 e it would work best on Wednesday till 16.00 and Thursday and Friday the
  whole day.\n\nThanks again for the opportunity for a third meeting and 
 best regards\,\nPhilipp Wegscheider\n\n\n\n 
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250128T123000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250128T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20250123T112918Z
SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:MGR3 - Paper Third Meeting
