BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250204T111600Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear Mark\,\n\nI don’t have any classes until March 5\, so i
 t makes no difference for me. Whenever it works best for you\, I can be 
 there.\n\nAm Dienstag\, Februar 04\, 2025 11:54 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams
  <mark.adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nWhich evening do you have classes
 ? We might be able to do it on an evening when you are here anyway. \n \
 n\n On 04.02.25 11:53\, Venus Harajchi wrote:\n \nDear Mark\,\n\nI don’t
  have any classes\, but of course\, I can be at Technikum at 17:00.\n\nA
 m Dienstag\, Februar 04\, 2025 11:29 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams <mark.adam
 s@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nYou have evening classes right? Can you be a
 t the Technikum at 17:00 on 18th?\n On 04.02.25 11:02\, Venus Harajchi w
 rote:\n \nDear Mark\,\n\nthank you for your response. I can be at Uni fr
 om February 18 onwards. When would work best for you?\n \nBest regards\n
 Venus\n\nAm Dienstag\, Februar 04\, 2025 10:19 CET\, schrieb Mark Adams 
 <mark.adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nDear Venus\, \n \nI think we shoul
 d meet to talk about your exam before we talk about the grade. We can ma
 ke an appointment at the beginning of next semester when you are back at
  Technikum and then we decide how to go from there. \n \nCan you please 
 let me know when you are back at Technikum and available?\nThanks.\n\n O
 n 03.02.25 18:25\, Venus Harajchi wrote:\n \nDear Mark\,\n\nI noticed th
 at all my classmates have received their grades\, but I have not yet rec
 eived mine. I wanted to kindly ask if there is any update regarding my g
 rade.\nI would appreciate any information regarding this matter.\n\nThan
 k you for your time and consideration.\n\nBest regards\nVenus-- \nMark A
 dams\nKompetenzfeldleiter Social Skills and Communication\nFaculty of El
 ectronic Engineering & Entrepreneurship\n\nFH Technikum Wien\nHöchstädtp
 latz 6\, 1200 Wien\nT: +43 1 333 40 77-5178\nE:mark.adams@technikum-wien
 .at\nI:technikum-wien.at\n\nFachhochschule Technikum Wien\, ZVR-Zahl: 07
 4476426 \n \n\n\n\n -- \nMark Adams\nKompetenzfeldleiter Social Skills a
