DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr Adams\,\n13th Feb at 11.00 would be perfect!\nKind r
 egards\,\nChristian Zidaru\n\nAm Montag\, Januar 27\, 2025 19:33 CET\, s
 chrieb Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at>:\n\n \nHi\n\n13th Feb at 11.
 00?\n\nOn 27.01.25 13:56\, Christian Zidaru wrote:\n>\n> Dear Mr. Adams\
 ,\n>\n> I would like to sincerely apologize for reaching out to you so l
 ate \n> regarding scheduling a second meeting. Unfortunately\, I have no
 t been \n> able to make significant progress on my master’s thesis in th
 e past \n> few weeks\, nor have I managed to draft the methodology secti
 on into a \n> 2–3-page PDF to send to you.\n>\n> Since you have already 
 mentioned that a submission by January 31 is \n> essential for receiving
  a positive grade\, I completely understand and \n> accept that you have
  recorded a "not evaluated" for me. However\, as \n> the presentation of
  the progress on my master’s thesis is scheduled \n> for February 18\, a
 nd I need to upload my interim report by February \n> 16\, I would great
 ly appreciate it if we could arrange a second meeting \n> before then.\n
 >\n> Kind regards\,\n> Christian Zidaru\n>\n \n\n\n\n 
