CREATED:20250319T123233Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear participant\,\n\nYou have been invited to the Erasmus+ 
 conference "Promoting mobilities in STEM fields in Higher Education".\nT
 he conference will take place at Arcotel Wimberger in Vienna from 14 to 
 16 May 2025.\n\nOnline registration\nFor the further preparation of the 
 event we kindly ask you to complete the registration form<https://erasmu
 splus.oead.at/de/veranstaltungen/2025-05-14-16-promoting-mobilities-in-s
 tem-fields-in-higher-education/registration-mobility-in-stem-in-he> by 4
  April 2025 at the latest.\n\nProgramme and further information\nPlease 
 find the draft programme and further information on the webpage erasmusp
 lus.oead.at/stem-tca2025.\nThe programme will be completed during the fo
 llowing weeks and the webpage will be updated accordingly.\n\nAccommodat
 ion\n\n  *   The accommodation (Arcotel Wimberger) is pre-booked for two
  nights (14-16 May).\n  *   If you require additional nights\, please bo
 ok them directly via the hotel's website and inform the hotel to ensure 
 you can stay in the same room.\n\nShould you have any questions about th
 e event\, please contact us by e-mail: stem-tca@oead.at<mailto:stem-tca@
 oead.at>\n\nWe are looking forward to meeting you in Vienna!\n\nKind reg
 ards\,\n\n\nOrganizational Team\n\n\nOeAD\nAbteilung Internationale Hoch
 schulkooperation | Department for International Cooperation in Higher Ed
 ucation\nT +43 1 534 08-0 | F +43 1 534 08 - 999 | stem-tca@oead.at<mail
 to:stem-tca@oead.at>\n\nOeAD-GmbH - Agentur für Bildung und Internationa
 lisierung\nOeAD-GmbH - Austria's Agency for Education and Internationali
 sation\n1010 Wien | Ebendorferstraße 7\nSitz: Wien | FN 320219 k | Hande
 lsgericht Wien | ATU64808925\nwww.oead.at<http://www.oead.at/> | www.era
 smusplus.at<http://www.erasmusplus.at/>
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250516T140000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250514T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20250319T123339Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:STEM-TCA: Registration and further information
TRANSP:OPAQUE
