BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250403T133313Z
DESCRIPTION:Greetings!\n\nWe finally found a date that is ok for everyon
 e\, there was only one option. We will keep the meeting on 28th of May a
 t 08.00 PT / 09.00 AUT / 10.00 FIN time.\nI propose that we meet at the 
 CIP-project ZOOM-room found from the CIP MOODLE-site (at least it works 
 for everyone):\n\nhttps://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us/j/95819155076\n\nP.S
 . Philipp + Momir: please check that Momir has access to this ZOOM-room 
 😊\n\nProposed topics for the meeting:\n\n\n  *   enrolled student amoun
 ts per country (every country asks the candidates in April/May if possib
 le)\n  *   BIP-funding rules for 2025-2026 (Florian)\n  *   agreement fo
 r the project contents and topic (shall we keep the same or change/add s
 omething)\n  *   teachers who will  participate from each university\n  
 *   schedule for CIP 2025-2026 (Ari prepares the timetable)\n  *   stude
 nts´feedback from previous project\, places for improvement (Ari present
 s the feedback summary)\n  *   English part of the project changes/impro
 vements (Mark presents based on his email from 29th of January)\n  *   c
 reation of the next project Moodle site (Philipp)\n  *   agreement for t
 he next meeting time before the project start\n\n\n\nBest wishes\,\n\nAr
 i
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250528T100000
