DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr. Adams\,\nI still need a grade for the English lectu
 re in the 3rd semester. Due to some difficulties with my work\, I will b
 e giving my presentation on the third date.\nI am very sorry for the inc
 onvenience this may cause you. I am attaching my current version of the 
 paper and wanted to ask if it would still be possible to have a short di
 scussion in order to receive a positive grade.\nThe deadline for submitt
 ing the paper is April 29.\nThank you in advance for your response.\nBes
 t regards\,\nJan Gebhardt
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20250418T100000
