DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr. Adams\,\n\n \nThank you for your reply.\n\n \nTuesd
 ay\, 27th May at 16:00 works for me. I will be there on time.\n\n \nBest
  regards\,\nNuo Chen\n\n\n\nOn 星期三\, 五月 21\, 2025 15:59 CEST\, Mark Adam
 s <adams@technikum-wien.at> 撰寫:\n\n \nSorry\, I cannot do Thursday eveni
 ng. What about next week on Tuesday at 16:00?\n\n On 20.05.25 18:36\, Nu
 o CHEN wrote:\n \nDear Mr. Adams\,\n\n \nThank you very much for your re
 ply.\n\n \nUnfortunately\, I won’t be able to make it on Wednesday at 15
 :00\, as I have a physics class in the afternoon.\nWould it be possible 
 to schedule the appointment on Thursday instead? Please let me know if t
 hat would work for you.\n\n \nThank you again for your time and support.
 \n\n \nBest regards\,\nNuo Chen\n\n\n\nOn 星期二\, 五月 13\, 2025 11:12 CEST\
 , Mark Adams <adams@technikum-wien.at> 撰寫:\n\n \nDear Nuo Chen\, \n \nI 
 am unfortunately not at Technikum this week as I am at a conference. I c
 an offer you an appointment on Wednesday 21st May at 15:00. Please let m
 e know if that works for you. \n \n\n On 09.05.25 15:24\, Nuo CHEN wrote
 :\n \nDear Mr. Adams\,\n\n \nI hope you are doing well.\n\n \nI am writi
 ng regarding my recent English retake exam. Unfortunately\, I did not pa
 ss the test\, which I find quite disappointing\, especially because I st
 udied very hard and prepared thoroughly beforehand.\n\n \nI would really
  appreciate it if I could review my corrected exam\, especially the writ
 ing section. I would like to understand what mistakes I made and how far
  I was from passing\, so I can focus on improving those areas in the fut
 ure.\n\n \nThank you very much for your time and support.\n\n \nBest reg
 ards\,\nNuo\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n 
