DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Greetings!\n\nWe will select this time for ne
 xt Fall CIP/BIP-project meeting. This was the most optimal time so that 
 majority of us can be present.\nIsidro: if you can in any way adjust you
 r timetable so that you could also join\, that would be great! Otherwise
 \,  Jose can help you and introduce the project.\n\nWe will keep the mee
 ting on 3rd of September at 13-14 PT / 14-15 AUT / 15-16 FIN time.\n\nI 
 propose that we meet at the previous CIP-project ZOOM-room found from th
 e CIP MOODLE-site (at least it works for everyone):\n\nhttps://technikum
 -wien-at.zoom.us/j/95819155076\n\n\nProposed topics for the meeting:\n\n
 \n  *   review of the final timetable (Ari presents)\n  *   review of th
 e groups (Ari presents)\n  *   review of the Moodle platform (Philipp pr
 esents)\n  *   other matters to discuss and adjust to the project\n\nBes
 t wishes\,\n\nAri\n\n
