 bate each one in its turn\, reach a consensus about whether it should be
  accepted or rejectedc and move on. Ideally we should be aiming for thre
 e or four outcomes per session.\n \nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1
 b_5jbwb4k_QHsVOK4KLTD2r1jMl0R59IS4ZjCMtxwtk/edit?usp=sharing\n \nI would
  also ask you\, if you have not already\, to choose enter your preferred
  time(s) on the Coodle link I sent out as the first potential appointmen
 t would be on Tuesday.\n \nMany thanks\,\n \nDavid
