DESCRIPTION:Hi\,\n\nNext Friday works the best for me.\n9 am your time? 
 :)\n\nBr\,\n\nSanna\n\n\n________________________________\nFrom: Mark Ad
 ams <adams@technikum-wien.at>\nSent: Friday\, August 22\, 2025 12:05:37 
 PM\nTo: Sanna Jylhä <Sanna.Jylha@lapinamk.fi>\nSubject: Re: BIP\n\nHi Sa
 nna\,\nHave not really thought about the plans to travel yet. Theoretica
 lly I could probably travel to both\, but I am not sure whether that mak
 es sense. Anyway\, here are some suggestions for a meeting and maybe we 
 can discuss what we are going to do differently this time and who is goi
 ng to do what where (All Austrian times).\n\nMonday 25th - 9-12\nTuesday
  26th - 9-12\nFriday 29th 9-12\n\nLet me know if anything works there.\n
 \nBest regards\,\n------------------------------------------------------
 ---\nMark Adams\nKompetenzfeldleiter Social Skills and Communication\nFa
 culty of Electronic Engineering & Enterpreneuership\n\nFH Technikum Wien
 \nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\nTelefonnummer – +43 1 333 40 77-5178\nma
 rk.adams@technikum- wien.at\n\n[FHTW Logo für Signatur März 2024.jpg]\
 n\nOn 22.08.2025\, at 09:00\, Sanna Jylhä <Sanna.Jylha@lapinamk.fi> wrot
 e:\n\nHi Mark\,\n\nhow are you doing? Hope you had a nice and warm summe
 r.\nThis morning we had 5 degrees outside\, so a bit too cold too soon. 
 The sun is shining though and it is Friday. 😊\n\nHave you made your pla
 ns for the fast approaching fall and spring? Do you have possibilities t
 o travel? Remembering your heavy work load…\n\nWe just had a short discu
 ssion with the two Aris here to plan for BIP travels.\nAri P. is plannin
 g to come to Vienna\, Ari A. and I  have to check with our supervisors t
 o see what we can do.\nI think all of us would like to come to Vienna an
 d traveling to Vila Real is quite hard\, so it would be nicer to do with
  someone.\n\nWould you have time for a short meeting before the BIP sess
 ions start?\n\nBest regards\,\n\nSanna\n\n………………………………..\n\nSanna Jylhä\
 , Ms.\nFM I M.Sc.\nLehtori I Senior Lecturer\nEnglanti ja Ruotsi I Engli
 sh and Swedish Languages\nArktiset luonnonvarat ja talous I Arctic Natur
 al Resources and Economy\n\n<image001.jpg>\nTietokatu 1\, 94600\, Kemi\n
 Tel. +358 40 585 4236\nwww.lapinamk.fi<http://www.lapinamk.fi/>\n\nPohjo
 ista tekoa – The Northern Factor
