DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=fi-FI:Luottamuksellinen - Confidential (3Y)\n\nDear
  Marc\,\ncc. all\nThank you once again for presenting the Queer Engineer
 ing concept to Lapland University of Applied Sciences in November. Your 
 introduction to the model sparked a great deal of interest\, and we trul
 y appreciated the way you highlighted its role in strengthening equity\,
  safer practices and inclusive student participation.\n\nI would like to
  invite you all to a joint discussion on how we could explore potential 
 collaboration based on the Queer Engineering or other equality framework
  here at Lapland UAS. The aim is to identify concrete opportunities that
  would support both our students and our staff\, and to consider how the
  model could be adapted to our institutional context. If possible\, I wo
 uld ask you\, Marc\, to give a brief introduction to this subject (simil
 ar to the presentation you held in Finland).\n\nYou are warmly welcome t
 o join this meeting. In case this meeting is not possible to you\, Marc\
 , at this time\, pls do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nLooking forward t
 o continuing the conversation together.\n\nBest regards\,\nMirva Juntti\
 nHead of Responsibility and Sustainability\nLapland University of Applie
 d Sciences\n____________________________________________________________
