DESCRIPTION:Luottamuksellinen - Confidential (3Y)\n\nDear Marc\,\ncc. al
 l\nThank you once again for presenting the Queer Engineering concept to 
 Lapland University of Applied Sciences in November. Your introduction to
  the model sparked a great deal of interest\, and we truly appreciated t
 he way you highlighted its role in strengthening equity\, safer practice
 s and inclusive student participation.\n\nI would like to invite you all
  to a joint discussion on how we could explore potential collaboration b
 ased on the Queer Engineering or other equality framework here at Laplan
 d UAS. The aim is to identify concrete opportunities that would support 
 both our students and our staff\, and to consider how the model could be
  adapted to our institutional context. If possible\, I would ask you\, M
 arc\, to give a brief introduction to this subject (similar to the prese
 ntation you held in Finland).\n\nYou are warmly welcome to join this mee
 ting. In case this meeting is not possible to you\, Marc\, at this time\
 , pls do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nLooking forward to continuing th
 e conversation together.\n\nBest regards\,\nMirva Juntti\nHead of Respon
 sibility and Sustainability\nLapland University of Applied Sciences\n___
