BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20260226T141108Z
DESCRIPTION:Luottamuksellinen - Confidential (3Y)\n\nLet´s keep the plan
 ning meeting of CIP/BIP 2026-2027 project here.\n\nTuesday 31st of March
 :\n\n  *   11-12.30 PT time\n  *   12-13.30 AUT time\n  *   13-14.30 FIN
  time\n\nProposed topics (everyone can send the proposed topics to me an
 d I will update the calendar invitation):\n\n\n  *   Discussion: how the
  previous project went\, experiences etc.\n  *   BIP-rules: is FHTW the 
 host again? Required student amounts etc.\n  *   How many students per c
 ountry we will apply – suitable group amount\n  *   Personnel participat
 ing to the next project from each country\n  *   Topics for the next pro
 ject\n  *   Contact weeks for the next project\n  *   Date for the next 
 meeting (in May?) (will be more detailed planning meeting: detailed topi
 cs\, deadlines for the assignments etc.)\n\nBest wishes\,\n\nAri\n\nJoin
  ZOOM (link from the CIP/BIP-Moodle):\nhttps://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us
 /j/92338482783\n\n\n
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20260331T133000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205510Z
