DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Luottamuksellinen - Confidential (3Y)\n\nGree
 tings\,\n\nThis only time presented to be the most suitable for all (exc
 ept Florian but this time we discuss the contents of the project so Eras
 mus issues can be dealt separately).\nJose: you haven´t answered to the 
 Doodle but could you arrange your timetable so that you could join?\n\n1
 8th of May at 10.00 PT /11.00 AUT / 12.00 FIN time\n\nThe recommended ag
 enda (similar from last year\, everyone can add items):\n\n\n  *   proje
 ct student enrollment situation from each country\n  *   teachers who wi
 ll  participate from each university\n  *   project topics decision (det
 ails can be added later)\n  *   schedule for CIP 2025-2026 (Ari prepares
  the timetable Excel)\n  *   English part of the project and grouping ev
 ent (will Lena Stern participate?)\n  *   creation of the next Moodle si
 te (Philipp)\n  *   agreement for the next meeting time before the proje
 ct start (at the end of August?)\n\nBest wishes\,\nAri\nJoin ZOOM (link 
 from the CIP/BIP-Moodle):\nhttps://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us/j/923384827
 83\n\n
