CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260602T153726Z
DESCRIPTION:Luottamuksellinen - Confidential (3Y)\n\nGreetings\,\n\nRega
 rding BIP2026-2027 project´s next meeting\, this timeslot was most suita
 ble for all:  Wednesday 12th of August at 10 - 11.30 AUT / 11 - 12.30 FI
 N time\n\nThose who did not answer/participate to the Doodle\, please tr
 y to be able to join the meeting anyway.\n\nBest wishes\,\n\nAri\n\nTopi
 cs for the meeting (feel free to add)1:\n\n\n  *   final name for the BI
 P-project\n  *   review of the final topics:\n     *   Topic 1: Savonius
  or Darreus-rotor (Alexander presents the description)\n     *   Topic 2
 : PV-house design (Manuel presents the description)\n     *   Topic 3: H
 ydrogen car assembly (Stefan presents the description)\n  *   review of 
 the Moodle platform (Philipp presents)\, enrolled students from each Uni
 \n     *   writing the topic descriptions to Moodle platform\n  *   revi
 ew of the final timetable and ZOOM sessions (Ari presents)\n  *   team b
 uilding event time and date (Lena)\n  *   decision on forming two separa
 te BIP-projects – contact weeks in Kemi and in Portugal?\n  *   review o
 f the groups/formation of the groups (Ari presents)\n  *   other matters
  to discuss and adjust to the project (All)\n\n\nJoin ZOOM (link from th
 e CIP/BIP-Moodle):\nhttps://technikum-wien-at.zoom.us/j/92338482783\n\n
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Vienna:20260812T113000
DTSTAMP:20260910T205510Z
