DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nWe hope you have had a relaxing summer and are
  ready for the new academic year. From 9 - 13 November\, we will host ou
 r first ever THUAS International Week and we are very happy with so many
  enthusiastic guest speakers!\n\nOnline Q&A:\n\nWith this message\, we w
 ould like to invite you to our Q&A session\, that will take place on Thu
 rsday 17 September at 16:00 (CET). The session is intended to provide yo
 u with more information about our week and give you the opportunity to a
 sk any questions you might have.\n\nInput programme booklet:\n\nFurther 
 to that\, we would like to ask you to complete the following MS Forms: T
 HUAS International Week 2026 — Speaker Information Form<https://forms.cl
 oud.microsoft/e/T5BM5i6sra>. We will use your input to compile our progr
 am booklet. Our students will use the booklet to choose the sessions the
 y would like to participate in.\nMay we ask you to email us a profile pi
 cture we can use in our booklet? Our organization's IT settings do not a
 llow us to include this request in the MS Forms.\n\nThank you very much 
 and we are looking forward to speaking to you soon.\n\nBest wishes\,\n\n
 Ranu Paltantewari\nSabine Amft\nCasper Verschoor\n\n\nTHUAS Internationa
 l week project team\n\n\n\nThe Hague University of Applied Sciences\n\n\
 nJohanna Westerdijkplein 75\, 2521 EN\, The Hague\, The Netherlands\n\nA
 vailable: Monday - Friday\n\nthehagueuniversity.com<http://www.thehagueu
 niversity.com/>\n\n\n\n\n\n_____________________________________________
 ___________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJoin: http
 s://teams.microsoft.com/meet/313091829962563?p=quyuXww9gCSi2X2Xvr\nMeeti
 ng ID: 313 091 829 962 563\nPasscode: ML2wA3Y9\n________________________
 ________\nNeed help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US> | Syste
 m reference<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ODFmY
 jUwNGMtZmI1Ni00ZjI1LThkMjMtNWVjMDI4YzcxYTY0%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22
