DESCRIPTION:Dear Mr Adams\,\n\nI was actually referring to the meeting m
 entioned in the make-up work information\, which is supposed to take pla
 ce sometime between 7 and 11 September to present the practice PechaKuch
 a.\n\nI just wanted to ask when this meeting will take place. Of course\
 , I am aware that the exam itself is scheduled for 14 September.\n\nBest
  regards\,\nSüeda\n\nAm 04.09.26 an 10:08\, schrieb Mark Adams adams@tec
 hnikum-wien.at\n\nDear Sueda\,\nAs stated in your moodle course\, your e
 xam is on Monday 14th. You cannot chose the date of your exam as it is a
 iready timetabled and organised. Exams are not organised around students
  and their wishes.\nI will look at the compensation work and let you kno
 w as soon as possible\, whether everything is ok or not for your to do t
 he exam.\n\nSecond Sitting:\n\nIf you fail your English course\, there w
 ill be a repeat exam\, which will require knowledge of everything that w
 as covered in class and online during the semester. It will consist of a
  Pecha Kucha presentation (60%) and content questions to be answered ora
 lly (30%) and a vocabulary test (10%).\n\nDate: Monday 14 September 2026
  16.55 - 21.00\n\nBest regards\,\n--------------------------------------
 -------------------\nMark Adams\nKompetenzfeldleiter Social Skills and C
 ommunication\nFaculty of Electronic Engineering & Enterpreneuership\n\nF
 H Technikum Wien\nHöchstädtplatz 6\, 1200 Wien\nTelefonnummer – +43 1 33
 3 40 77-5178\nmark.adams@technikum-wien.at\n\n- FHTW Logo für Signatur 
 März 2024.jpg\, 25 KB\n\n> On 04.09.2026\, at 01:31\, Süeda Nacar <be25
 b068@technikum-wien.at> wrote:\n>\n> Dear Mr Adams\,\n>\n>\n> Attached y
 ou can find my completed work for Business English. I have worked throug
 h the self-study phases as well as the corresponding class work. Some of
  the class exercises are included as separate PDF files\, while most of 
 the other work is collected in the main PDF.\n>\n>\n> As discussed\, I d
 id not include Class 3 because I attended this class and completed both 
 the self-study preparation and the class work at the time. I have also a
 ttached a screenshot of my attendance as confirmation. Of course\, if yo
 u would still like me to add or repeat anything from Class 3\, I am very
  happy to do so. I also attached a screenshot of the Quizlet vocabulary 
 sets that Ms Spella had created for the course. These were the vocabular
 y sets used for the vocabulary tests\, so I am currently using them to p
 repare and learn the relevant vocabulary.\n>\n>\n> I hope I have include
 d everything that is required. If anything is missing\, unclear or needs
  to be corrected\, please let me know. I would be very happy to add or c
 orrect anything before our next meeting.\n>\n>\n> Regarding the meeting 
 next week\, it would be a really great help for me if we could arrange i
 t for 11th September\, if this also works for you. I have several other 
 exams and some private appointments in the days before\, so having the m
 eeting on the 11th would make it much easier for me.\n>\n>\n> Thank you 
 very much\n>\n>\n> Best regards\,\n>\n>\n> Süeda Nacar\n>\n>\n\n- anwese
 nheit.PNG\, 168 KB\n>\n\n- Class 2- Employee perks.pdf\, 78 KB\n>\n\n- C
 lass 4-search enginges texts.pdf\, 211 KB\n>\n\n- Work_Süeda_Nacar.pdf\,
  226.4 KB\n>\n\n- voc.PNG\, 115 KB\n>\n\n- Class 1-The Spectrum of Inves
 tors Task.pdf\, 161 KB\n>\n\n- Class 5-Companies and CSR...pdf\, 48 KB\n
 >\n\n- PechaKucha_Süeda_Nacar_Class1.ppt\, 2 MB\n>\n\n- PK!_Süeda_Nacar.
 pdf\, 350.3 KB\n>\n\n- Class2-Meeting functions task.pdf\, 102 KB\n>\n\n
 - Class 4-Annual Report Marshall Amplication.pdf\, 79.4 KB\n>
