CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Dear all\,\n\nWe hope you have had a relaxing
  summer and are ready for the new academic year. From 9 - 13 November\, 
 we will host our first ever THUAS International Week and we are very hap
 py with so many enthusiastic guest speakers!\n\nOnline Q&A:\n\nWith this
  message\, we would like to invite you to our Q&A session\, that will ta
 ke place on Thursday 17 September at 16:00 (CET). The session is intende
 d to provide you with more information about our week and give you the o
 pportunity to ask any questions you might have.\n\nInput programme bookl
 et:\n\nFurther to that\, we would like to ask you to complete the follow
 ing MS Forms: THUAS International Week 2026 — Speaker Information Form<h
 ttps://forms.cloud.microsoft/e/T5BM5i6sra>. We will use your input to co
 mpile our program booklet. Our students will use the booklet to choose t
 he sessions they would like to participate in.\nMay we ask you to email 
 us a profile picture we can use in our booklet? Our organization's IT se
 ttings do not allow us to include this request in the MS Forms.\n\nThank
  you very much and we are looking forward to speaking to you soon.\n\nBe
 st wishes\,\n\nRanu Paltantewari\nSabine Amft\nCasper Verschoor\n\n\nTHU
 AS International week project team\n\n\n\nThe Hague University of Applie
 d Sciences\n\n\nJohanna Westerdijkplein 75\, 2521 EN\, The Hague\, The N
 etherlands\n\nAvailable: Monday - Friday\n\nthehagueuniversity.com<http:
 //www.thehagueuniversity.com/>\n\n\n\n\n\n______________________________
 __________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meet
 ing\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/313091829962563?p=quyuXww9gC
 Si2X2Xvr\nMeeting ID: 313 091 829 962 563\nPasscode: ML2wA3Y9\n_________
 _______________________\nNeed help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt
 =en-US> | System reference<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%
 3ameeting_ODFmYjUwNGMtZmI1Ni00ZjI1LThkMjMtNWVjMDI4YzcxYTY0%40thread.v2/0
 ?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22a2586b9b-f867-4b3c-9363-5b435c5dbc45%22%2c%22
 Oid%22%3a%22ccd1d54b-0c9f-4d36-a764-6fe57b231e64%22%7d>\nFor organizers:
  Meeting options<https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId
 =ccd1d54b-0c9f-4d36-a764-6fe57b231e64&tenantId=a2586b9b-f867-4b3c-9363-5
